<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Vilinga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Vilinga via Tunganda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vilinga</para>
  <para style="toc3">Vil</para>
  <para style="mt1">VILINGA</para>
  <para style="mt2">via Tunganda</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Livulu lia Vilinga liapua muzimbu uakuputukila ua cikungulukilo na muje muualishandokelele kuhuma ku Yelusalema kuheta naku Yundeya, naku Samaliya, na kueka naua ngue muje vene Yesu ualekele vandongisi vendi tele kanda aye muilu (Vilinga 1:8) Eli livulu valisonekele kuli Luka uje naua ikeye uasonekele Muzimbu Uacili ua Luka. Uapuile cimbanda kaha naua uahakeleko mana mukusoneka via vusunga. Uasonekele ou Muzimbu Uacili ua Luka na Livulu lia Vilinga vioshe kuli Telefilo uje uapuile Kangelengu, vuno honi mavulu aua ua asonekelele naua na kuli vaka Kilistu hamo lika na Vangelengu na Vayunda (1:1).</para>
  <para style="ip">Eli livulu lia Vilinga valisonekele mukati ka miaka 60-64 AD muomu livulu eli liahuile tele kanda Paulu ahume mu kamenga. Luka naua uendele na kanganda Paulu kaha naua cilivene uasonekelele livulu lia Vilinga mu nganda ya Antioke. Livulu lia Vilinga liapua lia kutualelelaho ca Muzimbu Uacili ua Luka kaha liaputuka na vimpande via Yesu viakuya muilu. Vianehesele Luka linga asoneke eli livulu viapuile vimolika na vije viasonekele mu Muzimbu uendi Uacili ua Luka. Uatondele Telefilo hamo lika na vuingi vua vaka Kilistu linga vazivuke vije vivavalongesele kaha mukemo vene uasonekele vimpande via vusunga via vuyoye vua Yesu na muje vuka Kilistu vualishandokele.</para>
  <para style="ip">Livulu lia Vilinga lituhana cimueso ca cikungulukilo ca kulivanga na muje vati mucafua mukuyoya na lutsilielo muli Yesu. Vimueso via tunganda vitumuesa muje vati tunapande kuyoyela lika mu nzili ya Cimbembesi Uakulela mukushandola Muzimbu Uacili ku vakuetu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Cakulivanga Cimbembesi Uakulela akeja hali vandongisi kaha na cikungulukilo ciputuka kukola 1:1; 8:1</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Cakuhatako cikeco cikungulukilo vacipakesa kaha ciputuka kushandokela mu Yelusalema nakueka 8:2; 12:23</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Hanima yevi Paulu honi aya vungenzi vuendi vuakulivanga vua kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili 12:24; 14:28</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ambahoni mpunga iliuana mu Yelusalema mukuyongola vika vije vitondeka kuli vakakutava vavaha 15:1-35</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Cakuhatako Paulu aya ha vungenzi vuendi vuamucivali vua kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili 15:36; 18:22</para>
  <para style="io1">6. Hanima yevi aya naua vungenzi vuendi vuamucitatu vua kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili 18:23; 20:38</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Ambahoni Paulu vamukuta mu Yelusalema 21:26</para>
  <para style="io1">8. Cakumanusuila Paulu vamutuala ku Loma 27:28</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Kuli uakasingimiko Telefilo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 1:1">Mu livulu lia kulivanga Njasonekele hali vije vioshe Yesu ualingile na kulongesa cendi hume hambangelo, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />nakuheta litangua lije vamutualele muilu, hanima yakuhana vishika kuhitila mu Cimbembesi Uakulela ku tunganda vaje vahanguile. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Hanima ya kutsa na kusanguka cendi, ualisholuele ikeye vavenia kuli vakevo mu vingila vije viakele na vukaleho ngeci ikeye alinakuyoya. Ualisholuele kuli vakevo mu matangua akupua makumi auana nakuhandeka via Vumuene vua Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Tele acilinavo, uavashikile nguendi, “Keti vakahume mu Yelusalema vuno honi vaka vandamenene kuje cikulaheso ca Tate. Evi vikevio viahandekele vije vimuevuile kuli yange. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Muomu Yiuano ikeye uambuitikile na mema vuno honi ha matangua a mandende lika vakamimbuitika na Cimbembesi Uakulela.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu vamutuala muilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Omo tunganda vakele hamo na Yesu, vamuihuile nguavo, “Muene, nkuma ukahiluisila vumuene ku Isaleli ha ntsimbu inovene ndi?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Keti kuli yeni kuzivuka vintsimbu cipue matangua aje Tate anavuahesa kuya ku nzili yendi yakama. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Vuno honi mukatambula nzili omo Cimbembesi Uakulela akeja hali yeni, kaha mukapua vakaleho vange mu Yelusalema, na mu Yundeya muoshe na mu Samaliya, naku mamanusuilo a mavu.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Omo uamanusuile kuhandeka eci, vamujunduile naku mutuala muilu tele oku vamutalelela, lishelua liamuambatele kaha kuvamumuene naua.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Tele vali nakutalelela muilu oku alinakuya, taleni hajevene vamala vavali vaje vazalele via kutoka vemanene kuli vakevo. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Vehuile nguavo, “Vamala vaku Ngalileya, nkuma vika munemanena oku muatala muilu? Ou Yesu, uje ivanambata kuli yeni nakumutuala muilu, akeja naua mucifua cimo ngue muje muamumuene aya muilu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uje uahingile Yunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Ambahoni tunganda vahilukilile ku Yelusalema omo vahumine ku Munkinda ua Oliveta uje uakala kuyehi na Yelusalema, yapuile ntunda yakupua ngue kilomita imolika. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Omo vakovelele mu nganda, kaha vayile ku mulili ua kuilu kuje kuvakele Petulu, na Yiuano, na Yakomba, na Anduleo, na Filipu, na Tomasi, na Mbatolomeo, na Mateu, na Yakomba muna Alufeya, na Simoni Zelote, na Yundasa muna Yakomba. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Vakele nakulikunguluila hamolika mukulombela na mutima umo, hamo na vampuevo veka na Maliya vaina ya Yesu hamolika na vamunaina va Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Mu matangua aje Petulu uemanene hakati ka vaka kutsiliela hamolika na civunga cakupua cihita na vantu makumi avali (120) nakuhandeka nguendi, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Vamuanetu, visoneka vinapande vilishulisise muje Cimbembesi Uakulela kuhitila muli Ndaviti uahandekele hali Yundasa, uje uatuamenene vaje vakutile Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yundasa uapuile umo uetu, muomu vamuhanguile kupua uakuvipangi vietu.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Yundasa ha vimbongo vije viatambuile ku vilinga viendi via vipi, ualandeleho lihia muje muauile na kutsa, uatavukile lizimo na mila yendi yatutulukilile hambanza. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Vantu voshe vakele mu Yelusalema vacuvuile, kaha mu muyati uavo vatumbuile lije lihia nguavo Akalundama, “kulumbununa nguavo Lihia lia Maninga.”)<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />“Muomu vanacisoneka mu livulu lia Miaso nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Njivo yendi ipue yamupulungua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">keti mukale cipue umo.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">vacisoneka naua nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Muntu ueka akahinge ha vipangi viendi.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Nankuma tuapande kuhangula umo ha vamala vaje vanakala netu ntsimbu yoshe ije Muene Yesu uendanganene netu, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />kuputukila ku kumbuitika ca Yiuano nakuheta ha litangua lije omo vahumisile Yesu kuli yetu nakumutuala muilu. Ha cuma eci, umo uavo napande kupua mukaleho uetu ku kusanguka cendi.<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Nankuma, vahanguile vamala vavali, Yosefa uje ivalukile Mbalasambase (naua vamutumbuile nguavo Njasitase) na Maseyase. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Ambahoni valombelele nguavo, “Muene, uzivuka mutima ua muntu uoshe. Tumuese hali ava vavali iya uje unahangula, <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />kuambata cihela mu vipangi evi na kupanga vipangi via vunganda vije Yundasa uasezele nakuya ku mutambela uendi.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Kaha vavatelele nkela, na nkela yauililile hali Maseyase, nankuma vamupandakanene ku tunganda likumi na umo.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuija ca Cimbembesi Uakulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Omo litangua lia Pentekosita liahetele, vaka kutsiliela voshe vakungulukile mu cihela cimolika. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Hajevene muilu muahumine cililimo ngue kupekumuka ca mpunzi yakama, kaha yashulisile njivo yoshe muje muvatumamene. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Vamuene vije viafuile ngue milengi ya tuhia vije vialihangunukile kaha viakele hali umo na umo uavo. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Voshe vashulile na Cimbembesi Uakulela kaha vaputukile kuhandeka mu vindaka vieka, ngue muje Cimbembesi uavalingisile linga vahandekemo.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Honi mu Yelusalema muakele Vayunda vaka kuvuila Njambi liova vaje vahumine ku mafuti oshe ahano ha mavu. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Omo civunga cakama covuile kaje kalua, kaha vakungulukile hamolika. Voshe valikomokelele muomu muntu na muntu uoshe uovuile vaje vaka kutsiliela vali nakuhandeka mu muyati uendi. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Voshe valikomokelele cikuma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma ava vali nakuhandeka ngeci keti voshe Vangalileya ndi? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Nkuma cija vati honi tuva voshe tuvevua umo na umo mu muyati uetu vavenia? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Vamo vetu vahuma ku Palitiya, naku Mendiya naku Elame, vakuavo ku Mesopotamia, naku Yundeya naku Kapandosiya, vakuavo ku Pontiyasi naku vinganda vimo via Valoma via mu Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />vamo ku Filingiya naku Pamefiliya, vakuavo ku Ingito naku mitambela ya Limbiya kuyehi na Silene, vamo vangenzi vahuma ku nganda ya Loma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />(Vayunda navaje keti Vayunda vuno honi vakakava lika futisi ya Vayunda), vamo vetu vahuma ku Kelete naku Alambiya yetu tuva voshe tulinakuvevua vahandeka vikomoueso via Njambi mu miyati yetu.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Kaha voshe valikomokelele nakukala na citanga, kaha valihozuele umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Nkuma eci cilumbunuka vika?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Vuno honi vamo vavo vashendumuine vaka kutsiliela nakuhandeka nguavo, “Vantu ava vanapende viniu!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muzimbu ua Petulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Vuno honi Petulu uemanene na vakuavo tunganda likumi na umo, uahandekele na lizi liakutambeka ku civunga cije nguendi, “Vamala vaku Yundeya neni voshe muakala mu Yelusalema, zivukeni eci cuma, kaha ivuilileni muacili kuli evi njihandeka. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Cilivene, vantu ava kuvapendele ngue mumuli nakuyonguelamo, ino inapu ntsimbu ya mutania ua cimene. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Vuno honi evi vikevio viahandekele kananguizi Njuele nguendi.<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />Njambi ahandeka nguendi, ‘Eci cikeco njikalinga mu matangua a mamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">njiketila Cimbembesi uange hali muntu na muntu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Vana veni va vamala nava va vampuevo vakambulula vunanguizi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">na vakuenje veni vakamona vimona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">na vakulukazi veni vakalota vinjozi.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Mu matangua aje njiketila Cimbembesi uange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">cipue hali vangamba vange, va vamala nava va vampuevo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">kaha vakambulula vunanguizi.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Njikalinga vikomoueso muilu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">na vimueso hano ha mavu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:19">kukakala maninga, na tuhia, na vuisi vuakama.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Litangua likazivala vuii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">na ngonde ikavenga ngengu ngue maninga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">ntsimbu kanda litangua liakama lia vumpau vua Muene lihete.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Kaha uoshe akasana lizina lia Muene akovoka.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Yeni vamala vaku Isaleli! “Ivuilileni ku mezi aua, Yesu uaku Nazaleta uapuile yala uje nzili yendi yakama yavu Njambi yasholuele muacili kuli yeni vikomoueso na vimueso vije vialingile Njambi kuhitila muli ikeye hakati keni, ngue muje yeni vavenia mualizivukila. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Njambi mu kuzivuka cendi na mu viyongola viendi via laja ngeci Yesu vaka muhana ku mavoko eni, kaha yeni muamutsihile hakutava vaka vupi linga vamushukike ha cilindakano. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Vuno honi Njambi uamusanguile ku vatsi, uamupatuile ku nzili ya kutsa, muomu kucatavele linga kutsa cimupuise cinzinda. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Muomu Ndaviti uahandekele hali ikeye nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Njamuene Muene kulutue luange ntsimbu yoshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">muomu ali ku livoko liange lia cilio kaha kunjikajaja.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Nankuma mutima uange uvuahelela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">na mezi ange anashulu na nzolela.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">Kaha muvila uange ukahuima mu lutsilielo.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Muomu ku ukanjiseze mu vukalo vua vatsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">cipue kutava muka kulela uove linga apolele mu cihilo.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Unanjizivukisa vingila vituala ku muono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">ukanjishulisa na nzolela mukukala muyehi nove.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Vamuanetu, njihandeka kuli yeni nakusimpa hali kukuluila yetu Ndaviti uje uatsile na kumutsinda, na cihilo cendi hanga tucili naco na lelo lino. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ndaviti uapuile kananguizi, kaha uazivukile nguendi Njambi uamukulahesele na kulisinga nguendi akapuisa umo ua vatekuluila vendi kukala ha litanda lia vumuene. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Ndaviti ha kumona vije vikalingiua kulutue, uahandekele ha kusanguka ca Kilistu omo uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">‘Ikeye kuvamusezele mu vukalo vua vatsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">muvila uendi kuuapolelele mu cihilo.’<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Njambi nasangula ou Yesu ku vatsi, kaha yetu voshe tunapu vakaleho va viuma evi. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Ikeye hakumujundula kuya ku livoko lia cilio lia Njambi, nakutambula Cimbembesi Uakulela kuli Ishe uje yamu kulahesele, kaha netilahoni vije vimuli nakumona na kuivua hali yetu. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Muomu keti Ndaviti uje ualondele muilu, vuno honi ikeye uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Muene uahandekele kuli Muene uange nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">Tumama ku livoko liange lia cilio<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />noho njikapuisa vitozi vove vuliatelo vuove.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Nankuma vantu voshe Vaisaleli vanapande kuzivuka muacili ngeci ou ikeye Yesu, uje imuashukikile ha cilindakano ikeye Njambi yanapuisa Muene na Kilistu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Omo vantu vovuile evi, cavakuatele ku mitima yavo kaha vahandekele kuli Petulu na kuli tunganda vakuavo nguavo, “Eni vamuanetu, nkuma tuapande kulinga vati?”<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petulu uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muntu na muntu napande kutenguluka ku vipi viendi nakumumbuitika mu lizina lia Yesu Kilistu linga vamukonekele ku vipi viendi, kaha mukatambula vuana vua Cimbembesi Uakulela. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Muomu cikulaheso ca Njambi cinapu ceni na vana veni, na kuli voshe vaje vali kulahako, vaje voshe vakasana Muene Njambi yetu veje kuli ikeye.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Petulu uahandekele kuli vakevo na mezi eka akuvanangula nakuvalambelela nguendi, “Liovoleni yeni vavenia ku miyati eyi ya vilinga via vipi.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Vaje voshe vatambuile muzimbu ua Petulu vavambuitikile, kaha ha litangua lije kualivuezelele vantu vakupua makulukazi atatu (3, 0 0 0) <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Vakakateyele ku vilongesa via tunganda na mukukunguluka hamo, na mukupazula mbolo na mukulombela.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vuyoye vua vaka kutsiliela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Vikomoueso na vimueso viavingi vivalingile tunganda viovuisile vantu voshe liova. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Vaka kutsiliela voshe vakele hamo mukulitombola, kaha valipangelele vufuko vuavo voshe. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Valandesele viuma viavo na vufuko vuavo, kaha valipangezelele vimbongo hakati kavo, kuya muje muanajenekela muntu. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Ha litangua na litangua valikunguluile mu Njivo ya Njambi, vakele nakupazula mbolo mu vinjivo viavo na kulia viakulia viavo mukuvuahelela na mitima ya kulikehesa, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />nakushangazala Njambi, nakuvazanga ku vantu voshe. Ha litangua na litangua Muene uavuezeleleko vaje vantu vakele nakuovoka ku civunga cavo.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Petulu akanguisa yala muka kulomba ua cilema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Ha litangua limo Petulu na Yiuano vayile ku Njivo ya Njambi ha ntsimbu ya kulombela, yapuile ntsimbu ya mucitatu ya mutania. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Kuje ku cikolo civatumbuile nguavo Cikolo Cacili ca Njivo ya Njambi, kuakele yala umo uje uapuile cilema hume kukusemuka cendi. Vakele nakumutuala tuala ku cikolo ha litangua na litangua linga alombe vuana ku vantu vaje vakele nakukovela mu vimbalanda via Njivo ya Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Omo uamuene Petulu na Yiuano valinakukovela, uavalombele linga vamuhaneko cimo. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Petulu na Yiuano voshe vamutalele ntooma, kaha Petulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Tutale!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Nankuma uavatalele ntooma, uayonguele nguendi hamo vamuhanako cimo. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Vuno honi Petulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Kunjesi na Siliva cipue Ngolinde, vuno honi eci njilinaco cikeco cinjikuhana, mu lizina lia Yesu Kilistu uaku Nazaleta imana linga uende.” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Ambahoni uamukuatele ku livoko liendi lia cilio nakumukatula, hajevene viliato na tutsendengele tuendi viakele na nzili. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Uakatukile nakutumbuka kaha uaputukile kuenda, uakovelele hamo navo mu Njivo ya Njambi, uendele nakutumbuzoka na kushangazala Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Vantu voshe vaje vamumuene alinakuenda nakushangazala Njambi, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />omo vamuzivukele ngeci ikeye uje uakele nakutumama ku cikolo cije civatumbuile nguavo Cikolo Cacili ca Njivo ya Njambi nakulomba vuana, kaha voshe valikomokelele cikuma ha cuma cije calingiuile kuli ikeye.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu ambulula mu Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Omo uje yala uakakateyele kuli Petulu na Yiuano, vantu voshe valikomokelele kaha voshe vashatukililile kuli vakevo mu Mbalanda ya Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Omo Petulu uamuene vaje vantu, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni vaka Isaleli, nkuma vikahoni mualikomokela ha cuma eci, cipue nkuma vikahoni mututalela ntooma? Muayongola ngueni eci cinalingiua mu nzili yetu cipue mu vunjambi vuetu mukemo tunendesa ou muntu ndi? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Njambi ua Avilahama, na Isake na Yakomba, Njambi ya vakukuluila vetu, ikeye nahana vumpau kuli ngamba yendi Yesu, uje imuahanene kuli vaka kusuana nakumuviana ku mesho a Pilato, cipue Pilato tele ikeye uayonguela kumuecela. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Vuno honi yeni muamuvianene Uakulela na Vusunga kaha muashikile Pilato linga amiecelele muhuza na kumihanaye. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Kaha muamutsihile uje ikeye Vavenia muono, vuno honi Njambi uamusanguile ku vatsi. Yetu tunapu tuvakaleho ha cuma eci. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Mukutsiliela mu lizina lia Yesu, lizina liendi ikeye vavenia likelio liahana ou yala nzili, ou mumona nakuzivuka, nalutsilielo luakuhitila muli Yesu lunamuhana kukanguka kuacili ku mesho eni voshe.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Honi vamuanetu njazivuka nguange vije mualingile kuli Yesu, yeni na vantuama veni muavilingilile kunzimba. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Mu ngila eyi vene Njambi uashulisilile vije viahandekele laja kuhitila mu tunanguizi vendi voshe nguendi, Kilistu uendi akayanda. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Muomu ya cuma eci tengulukeni, kaha hilukeni kuli Njambi naua ngeci amikonekele ku vipi vieni, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Vintsimbu via kuhuima vikahuminina kuli Muene kaha akatuma Kilistu uendi uje yamihanguilile laja ikeye Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Napande kukala muilu noho ntsimbu ikaheta ije Njambi akapuisa viuma vioshe via viha, ngue muje muahandekele laja kuhitila muli tunanguizi vendi va kulela. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Muomu Mosesa uahandekele nguendi, ‘Muene Njambi yeni akamitumina kananguizi ngue muje muatumine yange, akapua umo uakuhuma hakati ka vantu veni, mukononoke vioshe vije viakamileka. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Uoshe uje kakononoka uje kananguizi vakamuhumisa ku vantu va Njambi naku munongesa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Tunanguizi voshe ngue muvana vahandekelamo, kuhuma kuli Samuele na vaje vezile munima yendi, navo naua vambuluile vije vilingiua matangua ano. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Mu vatekuluila va tunanguizi nava litavasano lije Njambi uahanene kuli vakukuluila veni ngue muahandekele kuli Avilahama nguendi, ‘Kuhitila muli vatekuluila vove miyati yoshe ya vantu hano ha mavu vaka vakuisula.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Omo Njambi uajunduile ngamba yendi, uamutumine kuli yeni ha kulivanga, mukumikuisula linga muntu uoshe ahume ku vilinga viendi via vipi.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Petulu na Yiuano ku mesho a mpunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Tele Petulu na Yiuano vacili nakuhandeka ku vantu, vamo vasasendote na ntuama ua Njivo ya Njambi na Vasanduki vezile kuli vakevo. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Vanienguele cikuma muomu vakele nakulongesa vantu nguavo Yesu nasanguka ku vatsi, eci camuesele ngeci vatsi vakasanguka. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Nankuma, vavakuatele nakuvahaka mu kamenga noho liamukuavo, muomu capuile laja cinguezi. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Vuno honi vavengi vaje vovuile lizi vatsilielele, kaha vuingi vua vaje vamala vapuile makulukazi atanu (5,000)<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Liamukuavo vantuama va Vayunda, na vakuluntu, na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko valikunguluilile hamo mu Yelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Valiuanene hamo na Anase Kasasendote Uakama na Kayafase na Yiuano na Elekizanda na voshe vaje vapuile vaka ntanga ya Kasasendote Uakama. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Omo vemikile Petulu na Yiuano ku mesho avo vatondele kuzivuka kaha vavehuile nguavo, “Nkuma nzili yeya cipue mu lizina lieya munalingi cuma eci?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Ambahoni Petulu hakushula na Cimbembesi Uakulela, uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Yeni vantuama va vantu na vakuluntu, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />nga muli nakutuihula lelo ha vilinga viacili vinalingiua kuli yala ou ua cilema na vati muje muanakangukilamo, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />yeni voshe munapande kuzivuka, na vantu voshe vamu Isaleli vanapande kuzivuka ngeci muntu ou nemana ku mesho eni nakanguka muacili mu lizina lia Yesu Kilistu ua ku Nazaleta, uje imuashukikile ha cilindakano, uje yasanguile Njambi ku vatsi. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Ou Yesu ikeye uje visoneka vihandeka nguavio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">‘Livue lije vaka kutunga vavianene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">likelio linapu cisimi ca mumbango caseho cikuma kupulakana vioshe.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Kutuasa kuuana kuovoka muli ueka naua, muomu kukuesi lizina lieka hano ha mavu lianahana Njambi ku vantu litunapande kuovokelamo.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Vaka mpunga vakomokele omo vamuene kusimpa ca Petulu na Yiuano muomu vamuene ngeci vapuile vantu vangoco vakuhona kulilongesa, kaha vavanongonuene ngeci vakevo vakele hamo na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Vuno honi hakumona uje muntu ivakanguisile nemana hamo na Petulu na Yiuano, kuvasele kuhandeka cuma cimo cakuvaluisa naua. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Nankuma, vavalekele linga vatuhuke mu njivo ya Mpunga, kaha vaputukile kulihandekesa hakati kavo nguavo, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />“Nkuma vika tunapande kulinga kuli ava vamala? Muomu muntu uoshe mu Yelusalema nazivuka eci cikomoueso caciha civanalingi, kaha kutuasa kuciviana. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Vuno honi kuvindika cuma eci ngeci keti citsimane naua hakati ka vantu, tunanguleni ava vamala linga keti vahandeke naua kuli muntu mu lizina lia Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Nankuma, vavasanene mukati nakuvashika linga keti vahandeke cuma cimo cipue kulongesa naua mu lizina lia Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Vuno honi Petulu na Yiuano vavakumbuluile nguavo, “Yeni vavenia uaneni cuma muka cacili ku mesho a Njambi, kuononoka yeni indi kuononoka Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Muomu kutuasa kuholoka kuhandeka viuma vije vitunamono nevi vitunevu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Hanima yakuvanangula cikuma kaha vavecelele. Vamuene ngeci capuile cacikalu kuvahana kashitiko, muomu vantu voshe vashangazalele Njambi ha vije vialingiuile. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Uje yala ivalingilile cikomoueso cakumukanguisa uakele na miaka yakupulakana makumi auana.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaka kutsiliela valombelela ha kusimpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Omo Petulu na Yiuano vavecelele, vahilukile ku vantu vavo nakuvaleka vije vivahandekele vakuluntu va vasasendote na vantuama kuli vakevo. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Omo vaka kutsiliela vovuile viuma evi, voshe vakungulukile hamo nakulombela kuli Njambi nguavo, “Muene Samatanga ua lilu na mavu, na cisali na vioshe vije vilimo! <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Yove uahandekele na Cimbembesi Uakulela kuhitila muli kukuluila uetu Ndaviti, ngamba yove, omo ikeye uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">“‘Nkuma vika ava keti Vayunda vanienguele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">na muomu ya vika vantu vatumba matumbe akuhona seho?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Vimiene va hano ha mavu valivuaheselele vualumo vakevo vavenia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">na vaka kusuana valikunguluile hamo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">nakuluisa Muene na Kilistu uendi.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Cilivene Helonde na Pontiyu Pilato valikunguluile hamo mu nganda ino hamo na vaje keti Vayunda na vantu Vaisaleli nakuluisa ngamba yove uakulela Yesu, uje iuavuavesele. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Valikunguluile nakulinga vioshe vije viuatondele laja na nzili yove na cizango cove linga vikalingiue. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Kaha vuavuno, Muene, tala muvali nakutushunguiya, kaha tava linga vangamba vove vambulule lizi liove na kusimpa coshe. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Sholola livoko liove mukukanguisa nakulinga vimueso na vikomoueso mu lizina lia Ngamba yove uakulela Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Omo vamanusuile kulombela, cihela cije vakungulukilile caliningangele. Kaha voshe vashulile na Cimbembesi Uakulela nakuambulula lizi lia Njambi nakusimpa.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaka kutsiliela valipangezela vufuko vuavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Civunga ca vaka kutsiliela vakele na mutima umolika na viyongola vimolika, naumo uahi uatumbuile viuma viendi vije viafukile kupua viendi, vuno honi valipangezelele vioshe viavo vije vivakele navio. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Kaha na nzili yakama tunganda vambuluile vukaleho vua kusanguka ca Muene Yesu, kaha na kavumbi kakama kakele hali vakevo. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Kukuakele umo hakati kavo uajenekele cuma, muomu vaje vakele na mehia cipue vinjivo vavilandesele kaha vanehele vimbongo vivatambuile ku viuma vije valandesele <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />nakuvihana kuli tunganda, kaha vavipangezelele ku muntu na muntu kuya kukujeneka cendi.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Kaha Yosefa, Kalevi uje uasemukilile mu Sepulasi, uje tunganda vamutumbuile nguavo Mbanambase, kulumbunuka nguavo “Muka kukolesa vakuavo,” <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />ualandesele lihia liendi, kaha uanehele vimbongo nakuvihana ku tunganda.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananiya na Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Honi kuakele yala umo lizina liendi Ananiya, na mpueyendi Safila valitavasanene kulandesa mutambela ua vufuko vuavo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Hakulitavasana na mpueyendi uashuekele mutambela ua vufuko, kaha uatualele mutambela umo ua vimbongo kuli tunganda. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Ambahoni Petulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Ananiya, nkuma vika unatavela Satana akovele mu mutima uove nakuhandeka makuli kuli Cimbembesi Uakulela hakushueka mutambela ua vimbongo viunatambula hakulandesa lihia? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Tele kanda ulilandese, liapuile liove, naua nahanima yakulilandesa, vimbongo viapuile viove. Nkuma vika uayonguela kulinga cuma eci? Ku uakuisile lika vantu vuno honi unakuisa Njambi!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Hajevene omo Ananiya uovuile mezi aua, uauililile ha mavu na kutsa, kaha vantu voshe vaje vuovuile evi vakele na liova. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Vakuenje vezile nakuzenga muvila uendi, kaha vamutualele hambanza na kumutsinda.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Omo kuahitile vintsimbu vitatu mpueyendi uezile, kazivukile cuma cije calingiuile. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petulu uamuhuile nguendi, “Njileke nga evi vikevio vimbongo vimunalandesele lihia lieni yove na yaliove?” Kaha Safila uamukumbuluile nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">“Eyo, vikevio vene evi.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Vuno honi Petulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nkuma vika yove na yaliove muayongola kueseka Cimbembesi ua Muene? Tala, vamala vaje vanakatsinda yaliove ava vali ku cikolo, vakevo vakutuala nove naua.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Hajevene Safila uauililile ha mavu ku viliato via Petulu na kutsa. Omo vaje vakuenje vakovelele vamuuanene natsi, kaha vamutualele nakumutsinda kuyehi na yaliendi. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Cikungulukilo coshe na vantu voshe vaje vovuile viuma evi vakele na liova liakama cikuma.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vimueso na vikomoueso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Tunganda valingile vimueso na vikomoueso viavingi hakati ka vantu. Kaha vaka kutsiliela voshe vakungulukilile hamo mu Mbalanda ya Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Cipue vene vantu vavashangazalele cikuma, vuno honi naumo uahi ualipandakanene navo. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Vantu vavengi valivuezelele ku civunga cavo, civunga ca vamala na vampuevo vaje vatsilielele kuli Muene. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Nankuma, ku vije vivalingile tunganda, vantu vakele nakuneha vaka kuvavala ku vitapalo nakuvalangeka ha mihela na ha vitala tala linga Cimbembe ca Petulu cihite helu lia vamo omo ahita kuyehi navo. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Vivunga via vantu vavengi vezile kuhuma ku membo akuzenguluka Yelusalema, vanehele vaka kuvavala na vaje vakele nakuyanda ku vimbembesi via kujuala, kaha voshe vavakanguisile.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tunganda vavapakesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Ambahoni kasasendote uakama na vakuavo vaje va mu mpunga ya Vasanduki, vovuile cipululu kaha vakele na vutumbe vua kuvaluisa. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Vakuatele tunganda nakuvahaka mu kamenga ka civunga. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Vuno honi ku vutsiki vujevene kangelo ua Muene uashokoluele vikolo via kamenga, kaha uatuhuisile tunganda hambanza, nakuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Yeni mukemane mu Njivo ya Njambi nakuleka vantu vioshe via muono ou ua uha.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Omo vovuile evi vakovelele mu Njivo ya Njambi cimene mene nakuputuka kulongesa vantu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Honi omo Kasasendote uakama na vantu vendi vahetele kaha vasanene mpunga hamo na vakuluntu voshe va vantu Vaisaleli, kaha honi vatumine vantu ku kamenga linga vanehe tunganda ku mesho avo. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Vuno honi omo vaje vaka kuniunga Njivo ya Njambi vahetele kuje, kuvauanene vaje tunganda mu kamenga, nankuma vahilukile ku Mpunga nakuambulula nguavo, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Omo tuahetele ku kamenga tuauanene kuakupata ngongongo na vaka kuniunga voshe tele vanemana ku vikolo, vuno honi omo tuashokoluele kutuauanenemo muntu cipue umo mukati uahi.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Omo vakuluntu va vasasendote na mukuluntu ua vaka kuniunga Njivo ya Njambi vovuile viuma evi, valikomokelele cikuma nguavo cuma muka cinalingiua. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Ambahoni yala umo uezile nakuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Taleni, vaje vamala vamunahakele mu kamenga vali mu Njivo ya Njambi nakulongesa vantu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Ambahoni, uje mukuluntu ua vaka kuniunga Njivo ya Njambi uayile na vantu vendi mukuambata tunganda. Kuvaka pangesele nzili muomu vovuile liova nguavo hamo vantu vavasha mavue.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Omo vanehele tunganda, vavemikile ku mesho a Mpunga. Kaha kasasendote uakama uavehuile nguendi, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Tuamishikile nguetu keti mulongese naua mu lizina lia yala ou, vuno honi yeni munashandola laja vilongesa vieni mu Yelusalema muoshe kaha mutonda naua mutuhake mulonga ua kutsa cendi!”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Vuno honi Petulu na tunganda vakuavo vavakumbuluile nguavo, “Tunapande kuononoka cikuma Njambi kupulukana vantu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Njambi ya vakukuluila vetu ikeye uasanguile Yesu ku vatsi, uje imuatsihile mukumushukika ha cilindakano. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Njambi uamujunduile nakumutuala ku livoko liendi lia cilio na kumupuisa Ntuama na Muyoyesi linga akahane Isaleli ntsimbu yakutenguluka ngeci vavasambese ku vipi viavo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Tuvakaleho va viuma evi, yetu hamo na Cimbembesi Uakulela uje Njambi nahana kuli vaje vamuononoka.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Omo vaje vaka Mpunga vovuile evi, vanienguele cikuma nakutonda linga vatsihe tunganda. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Vuno honi umo uavo, uje uapuile Kafaliseo lizina liendi Ngamaliele, uapuile mulongisi ua mezi a Lishiko kaha naua vantu vamusingimikile cikuma, uakatukile nakushika Mpunga linga vacituhule tunganda hambanza muka ntsimbu kakandende lika. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Kaha uahandekele ku Mpunga nguendi, “Yeni vakuetu Vaisaleli, zangameni ha viuma evi mulina kulinga kuli ava vamala. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Ha vintsimbu via kunima kuasholokele Teundase uje ualipuisile uakama, kaha vamala vakupua vihita viuana (400) valipandakanene nendi. Vuno honi vamutsihile kaha na vaje voshe vamukavele valishandokele, kaha cije civunga cendi cahuile. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Munima yendi Yundasa Kangalileya uasholokele ha ntsimbu yakutanda vantu, uakokele civunga cakama vuno honi nendi naua vamutsihile kaha na vaje voshe vamukavele valishandokele. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Nankuma, ha cimpande eci njimileka nguange, keti mueseke kulinga cuma cimo hali ava vamala. Veceleni! Nga evi vanayongola nevi vali nakulinga vinahumu ku vantu, kaha vikahua, <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />vuno honi nga vinahumu kuli Njambi, kaha kumuasa kuvahiana. Ha mulonga ou mukaliuana lika muli nakuluisa Njambi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Kaha Mpunga yakavele kunangula ca Ngamaliele. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Nankuma, vasanene vaje tunganda linga vakovele, vavapupile nakuvashika nguavo keti naua vahandeke mu lizina lia Yesu, kaha vavecelele. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Ambahoni omo tunganda vasezele ije Mpunga, vavuahelelele cikuma muomu Njambi uavayonguelele kuyanda nakushauka muomu ha lizina lia Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Kaha ha litangua na litangua vakele nakulongesa nakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Yesu Kilistu mu Njivo ya Njambi na mu vinjivo via vantu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Vahangula vakuasi vatanu na vavali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Mu matangua aje, omo vandongisi vakele nakulivuezelela, kuakele Vayunda vaje vakele nakuhandeka ndaka ya Cingelengu valingile vimpata na Vayunda vaje vakele nakuhandeka ndaka ya Cihevelu, muomu vantuluue vavo vakele nakuvayengula hakuhana viakulia via ha litangua na litangua. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Nankuma, vaje tunganda likumi na vavali vasanene vandongisi voshe nakuhandeka kuli vakevo nguavo, “Kucitava tuecele kuambulula lizi lia Njambi linga tutale ha cimpande ca kupangezela viakulia. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Nankuma, vamuanetu, hanguleni vamala vatanu na vavali hakati keni vaje vamuzivuka ngeci vanashulu na Cimbembesi Uakulela na mana, tuvahake linga vapange cipangi eci. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Kaha yetu tukalihane lika ku kulombela nakupanga vipangi viakuambulula.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Civunga coshe cavuahalelele cikuma na viyongola via tunganda, nankuma, vahanguile Setefano, yala uakushula na lutsilielo na Cimbembesi Uakulela, hamolika na Filipu, na Polokolase, na Nikanole, na Timoni, na Palamanase, na Nikolau uje keti Kayunda ua ku Antioke uje uakavele futisi ya Vayunda. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Civunga cemikile vaje vamala ku mesho a tunganda, vaje vakevo vavalombelelele nakuvasaleka mavoko.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Kaha lizi lia Njambi liashandokelele kuoshe. Civunga ca vandongisi mu Yelusalema calivuezelele cikuma, na civunga ca vasasendote vavengi vatsilielele.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Setefano vamukuata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Kaha honi Setefano, mukushula na kavumbi ka Njambi na nzili, ualingile vimueso na vikomoueso viakama hakati ka vantu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Vamuluisile kuli vamala vamo vaje vapuile vaka njivo ya malombelo ya Vamala Vakupatuka (ngue muje muvaitumbuile), muje muakele Vayunda vakuhuma ku Silene na ku Alekizandiliya. Vakuavo vahumine ku nganda ya Silisiya na ku Asiya valingile vimpata na Setefano. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Vuno honi Cimbembesi uahanene Setefano mana linga omo ahandeka, naumo uahi uasele kumuhiana kulinga nendi vimpata. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ambahoni vahanene vamala vamo lizika kanua linga vahandeke nguavo, “Tunamuvu alinakuhandeka mezi akushaula Mosesa na Njambi.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Kaha mu ngila eyi vene vashongangeyele vantu na vakuluntu na valongisi va mezi a Lishiko. Vakuatele Setefano nakumutuala ku Mpunga. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Ambahoni vanehele vakaleho va makuli vaje vamuvangeyele nguavo, “Ou yala ntsimbu yoshe alinakuluisa Njivo ya Njambi ya kulela na Lishiko lia Mosesa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Muomu tunovu ahandeka nguendi ou Yesu ua ku Nazaleta akasiula Njivo ya Njambi, nakutengulula futisi yatuhanene Mosesa.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Voshe vatumamene muje mu Mpunga mesho avo atalele hali Setefano, kaha vamuene cihanga cendi casholokele ngue ca kangelo.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Mezi a Setefano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Kaha Kasasendote uakama uehuile Setefano nguendi, “Nkuma viuma evi vinapu via vusunga ndi?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Kaha Setefano uavakumbuluile nguendi, Vamuanetu na vatate njivuilileni! Njambi ua vumpau ualisholuele kuli kukuluila uetu Avilahama tele acili mu Mesopotamia, ntsimbu kanda acikale mu Halane, <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />kaha uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Seza cifuti cove na ntanga yove kaha ya ku cifuti cije cinjikakumuesa.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Ambahoni uasezele cifuti cendi ca Kalundiya uayile nakukala mu cifuti ca Halane. Hanima ya kutsa ca ishe ya Avilahama, kaha Njambi uamuhumisile mu cifuti cije nakumuneha mu cifuti cino cimuli nakukala hano. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Njambi kahanene Avilahama mutambela umo ua cifuti linga upue uendi, cipue kamutambela kakandende ka kuliata ka livu, vuno honi Njambi uamukulahesele kumuhanaco linga cipue cendi na vatekuluila vendi cipue vene tele Avilahama kanda akale na muana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Kaha evi vikevio viahandekele Njambi nguendi, ‘Vatekuluila vove vakakala mu cifuti ca vungezi, kaha vakapua vandungo nakuvayandesa cikuma ha miaka yakupua vihita viuana (400) <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Njikasompa vantu vaje va vakapangela, kaha hanima ya viuma evi vatekuluila vove vakahuma mu cifuti cije, kaha vakanjilemesa mu cihela cino vene.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Ambahoni Njambi uahanene Avilahama cilika cakulovoka kupua cimueso ca litavasano. Nankuma, Avilahama uapuile ishe ya Isake kaha uamulovuele omo kuahitile matangua atanu na atatu kuhuma ha kusemuka cendi, kaha Isake ualovuele munendi Yakomba, na Yakomba ualovuele vana vendi likumi na vavali, vaje vakevo vakukuluila vakutsimana va muyati uetu.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />“Kaha vakuavo vana va Yakomba vovuilile cipululu shongo yavo Yosefa, vamulandesele ku vundungo mu Ingito. Vuno honi Njambi uakele hamo nendi, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />nakumuniunga muacili mu tuyando tuendi tuoshe. Omo Yosefa uasholokele ku mesho a Falao muene ua Ingito, Njambi uamuhanene mana na kavumbi, kaha muene ua Ingito uapuisile Yosefa nguvulu uakuyula Ingito yoshe ya njivo ya muene. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Ambahoni kuakele njala yakama mu cifuti coshe ca Ingito na mu Kanana, kaha njala yakama ije yanehele tuyando tuakama. Kaha vakukuluila vetu kuvasele kuuana viakulia, <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />vuno honi omo Yakomba uovuile nguavo ku Ingito kuli viakulia, uatumineko vana vendi, vakukuluila vetu, ha vungezi vuavo vua kulivanga. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Kaha ha vungenzi vuavo vua mucivali Yosefa ualisholuele kuli vamunaina, kaha Falao muene ua Ingito uazivukile ntanga ya Yosefa. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Nankuma, Yosefa uatumine lizi kuli ishe Yakomba linga vakamuleke hamo na ntanga yendi ngeci veje ku Ingito, vapuile makumi atanu na avali na vantu vatanu (75) <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Ambahoni Yakomba uasikumukile uayile ku Ingito, ikeye na vakukuluila vetu vakatsililileko. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Mivila yavo vaitualele ku Shekeme kuje vakavatsindile mu cihilo cije calandele Avilahama na vimbongo kuli vana va Hamole.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />“Vuno honi omo ntsimbu yahetele muyehi linga Njambi ashulisise cikulaheso cendi kuli Avilahama, vantu vetu valanene cikuma mu Ingito. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Kaha kuasuanene muene ueka mu Ingito uje kazivukile Yosefa. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Ikeye uazangamesele vakukuluila vetu nakuvapangesa mua mupi, nakuvasindiya linga vombile kuti tukeke vavo linga vatse. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Ha ntsimbu ije vene Mosesa uasemukile, uapuile muanike uacili cikuma ku mesho a Njambi. Vamulelele mu njivo ya ishe ha vingonde vitatu, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />kaha omo vamuhumisile mu njivo yavo, muna muene Falao uampuevo uamuambatele nakumulela muacili ngue munendi. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Mosesa vamulongesele mana oshe a vaka Ingito, kaha uapuile yala uakama mukuhandeka cendi na mu vilinga.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />“Omo Mosesa uakele na miaka makumi auana (40), cahuminine kuintsi lia mutima uendi kuya nakumenekela vavushoko vendi vaka Isaleli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Kaha omo uamuene Kaingito ali nakuyandesa umo ua kuli vavushoko vendi, nankuma, uashueneneko nakuohiela uje Kaisaleli kaha uatsihile uje Kaingito. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Uayonguele nguendi hamo vantu vendi vovuisisa ngeci Njambi alinakumupangesa linga akavohiele, vuno honi kuvazivukile. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Ha litangua liamukuavo Mosesa uamuene Vaisaleli vavali valinakulua, kaha uezile mukati kavo nakuhandeka kuli vakevo na mezi a ciyulo nguendi, ‘Eni vamala ivuilileni, yeni muvushoko vueni, nkuma vika mulina kuliluisa umo na mukuavo?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Vuno honi uje yala uakele nakuluisa mukuavo uanakuile Mosesa nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Nkuma iya nakupuisa muka kusuana cipue lihako hakati ketu? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Nkuma utonda linga unjitsihe naua ngue munatsihile uje Kaingito izau ndi?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Omo Mosesa uovuile mezi aua, uateuele mu Ingito nakuya nakukala mu cifuti ca Mindiyani. Kaha kuje uakakele na vana vavali va vamala.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Omo kuahitile miaka makumi auana (40), kangelo uasholokele kuli Mosesa mu mulengi ua tuhia tuje tuakele nakushukuma mu liputa mu mpambo kuyehi na Munkinda ua Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Omo Mosesa uamuene evi ualikomokelele ha cuma cije camuene, kaha uashuenene kuyehi na liputa mukumonesesa muacili. Vuno honi uovuile lizi lia Muene ngualio, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Yange Njambi ya vakukuluila vove, Njambi ya Avilahama, na Isake na Yakomba.’ Kaha Mosesa uajajele nakuvua liova, kaha kataleleko naua. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Ambahoni Muene uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, ‘Shulula vinkaku viove, muomu ha mutambela ha unemana hanapu ha kulela. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Njinamono omo muvali na kuyandeselamo vantu vange vaje vali mu Ingito. Kaha njinevu kulinienieta cavo, njineja ha mavu nakuvamena. Kaha ija, ngeci njikakutume ku Ingito.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Ou ikeye Mosesa uje ivavianene omo vahandekele nguavo, ‘Nkuma iya nakupuisa muka kusuana cipue lihako hakati ketu?’ Ikeye vene uje yatumine Njambi kupua muka kusuana na muka kupatula kuhitila muli kangelo uje uasholokele kuli ikeye mu liputa lije liakele nakuuema. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Ikeye uahumisile vantu mu Ingito, ualingile vimueso na vikomoueso mu Ingito, na ku Cisali ca Kuvenga naua na mu mpambo ha miaka makumi auana (40) <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />“Ou ikeye Mosesa uje ualekele vantu Vaisaleli nguendi, ‘Njambi akahumisa kananguizi ngue yange uje akahuma hakati ka vantu veni vavenia.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Ikeye uakele hamo na vantu Vaisaleli omo vakungulukilile mu mpambo, naua hamo na vakukuluila vetu na kangelo uje uahandekele kuli ikeye ha Munkinda ua Sinai, kaha uatambuile muzimbu ua kuyoya ua Njambi nakutuhanauo.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Vakukuluila vetu vavianene kumuononoka, kaha vamunakuililile kumukulo nakutonda linga vahilukile naua ku Ingito. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Nankuma, vahandekele kuli Alone nguavo, ‘Tupangele vanjambi linga vatutuamenene. Kutuzivuka cuma muka cinalingiua kuli Mosesa uje uatuhumisile ku Ingito.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Yapuile ntsimbu ije ivamungile kamponia mu cifua ca muna ngombe ua nkomba nakukombelelako nkombelo nakulinga ciuano cakusingimika cipangi ca mavoko avo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Vuno honi Njambi uavatalesele nima, kaha uavecelele linga valemese viuma via muilu, ngue muvanasoneka mu livulu lia tunanguizi nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">“‘Vantu Vaisaleli! Keti yange uje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">muatsihilile nakukombelela tusitu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ha miaka makumi auana mu mpambo.<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Yapuile mbalaka ya njambi Moleki ikeyo ije imuambatele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">na cifua ca Lefane, njambi yeni ua ntanga ntanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ava vakevo tumponia tueni tuje tumuapangele linga mutulemese.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Nankuma, njikamituma ku vunzinda musinia lia Mbambilone.’”<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Vakukuluila vetu vakele na mbalaka yakulihanena vukaleho mu mpambo. Vaipangele ngue Njambi muashikile Mosesa linga vaipangemo, kuya mu cifua cije vene civamuesele Mosesa. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Vakukuluila vetu vaje vatambuile mbalaka kuli vaishavo vayambatele omo vayile na Yoshua nakutambula cifuti ku miyati ije yashekelemo Njambi omo vakele nakuya kulutue. Nankuma, yakele kuje noho ha ntsimbu ya Ndaviti. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Ikeye vene Ndaviti uje uauanene kavumbi ku mesho a Njambi, kaha ualombele Njambi amutavese linga atungile Njambi ya Yakomba Muakukala. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Vuno honi uapuile Solomoni uje uamutungilile njivo.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Vuno honi Njambi ua Helu Liavioshe kekukala mu vinjivo viakutunga na mavoko a vuntu, ngue muje alinakuhandeka kananguizi nguendi,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Muene ahandeka nguendi, lilu liapua litanda liange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">na mavu apua vuliatelo vuange.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Nkuma njivo ya muyati muka muasa kunjitungila?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Nkuma mutambela ua muyati muka munjasa kukala?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Nkuma keti livoko liange vene vavenia liapangele evi viuma vioshe ndi?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />“Yeni vantu vakukaluua,” Kaha Setefano uatualeleho kuhandeka nguendi, “Yeni vantu va mitima yakuhona kutsiliela, na matuitui eni anashoko ku lizi lia Njambi! Yeni naua muli nakuviana Cimbembesi Uakulela ngue muvalingile vakukuluila veni. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Nkuma iya kananguizi ivahonouele kuyandesa vakukuluila veni? Vatsihile tunganda va Njambi vaje kuntsenkulu vambuluile kuija ca Ngamba yendi ua Vusunga. Kaha honi yeni muamuendele vungungu nakumutsiha. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Yeni muatambuile Lishiko lia Njambi lije livamihanene tungelo, vuno honi kumua liononokele.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Setefano vamuasha mavue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Omo vaje vaka mpunga vovuile evi viuma kuli Setefano, vanienguele cikuma nakulishumanga ku mazo mukupihilila. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Vuno honi Setefano mukushula na Cimbembesi Uakulela uatalele muilu, kaha uamuene vumpau vua Njambi na Yesu nemana ku livoko lia cilio lia Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Uahandekele nguendi, “Taleni! Njinamono lilu linashokoloka na Muna Muntu nemana ku livoko lia cilio lia Njambi!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Vuno honi vaje vaka mpunga vatambekele na lizi liakama cikuma na kuzika matuitui avo. Kaha voshe vayile hamo vuasi kuli ikeye, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />ambahoni vamukokelele hambanza lia nganda, kaha vamuashele mavue. Vakaleho vasezele vikovelo viavo mukuviniunga kuli mukuenje umo lizina liendi Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Tele vali nakumuasha mavue, Setefano ualombelele nguendi, “Muene Yesu tambula Cimbembesi cange!” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Kaha uatsikamene ha mavuli endi nakutambakana na lizi liakama nguendi, “Muene, keti uanuke vupi vuavo ovu vuvanalingi!” Omo uahandekele mezi aua kaha uatsile.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="s">Saulu apakesa cikungulukilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Saulu uatavele kutsa ca Setefano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Ha litangua lije vene cikungulukilo ca mu Yelusalema caputukile kuyanda na mapakeso. Vaka kukutsiliela voshe valishandokelele mu mafuti a Yundeya na mu Samaliya kaha kuvanga lika tunganda vakevo vasalelemo. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Vamo vamala vaka kulemesa Njambi vatsindile Setefano, kaha vamulilile cikuma.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Vuno honi Saulu uesekele kunongesa cikungulukilo, uayile ku njivo na njivo nakukokangeya vamala na vampuevo nakuvahaka mu kamenga.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muzimbu uacili vauambulula mu Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Vaka kukutsiliela vaje vashandokele vayile ku mutambela na mutambela nakuambulula lizi. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipu uasikumukile ku nganda ya Samaliya nakuambulula muzimbu ua Kilistu ku vantu vaje vakele kuje. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Omo civunga ca vantu vovuile Filipu nakumona vimueso vije vialingile, kaha voshe vovuililile kuli vije viakele nakuhandeka. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Muomu vimbembesi via vipi viahumine mu vantu vavengi oku vitambakana na lizi liakama, vaka tulepa vavengi na vilema vakangukile. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Nankuma, mu nganda ya Samaliya muakele kujolela cakama.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Mu nganda ije muakele yala umo ua lizina lia Simoni, uje ha ntsimbu yahanima uakomokesele vaka Samaliya na mantseno endi. Ualimuesele ikeye vavenia kupua umo uakama, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />kaha vantu voshe muje mu nganda, vantu va vulemu na vaje keti va vulemu vovuililile kuli ikeye, kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Ou ikeye vene nzili ya Njambi uje ivatumbula nguavo Nzili Yakama.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Vakele nakumuvuilila muomu ha ntsimbu yalaha uavakomokesele na mantseno endi. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Vuno honi omo vatsilielelele uje muzimbu uahandekele Filipu kuli vakevo ua Muzimbu Uacili ua Vumuene vua Njambi na via Yesu Kilistu, kaha voshe vamala na vampuevo vavambuitikile. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Cipue Simoni nendi vene naua uatsilieliele, kaha omo vamumbuitikile uakele hamo na Filipu, ualikomokelele cikuma omo uamuene vikomoueso na vimueso viakama vije viakele nakulinga.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Omo tunganda vaje vakele mu Yelusalema vovuile nguavo vantu va mu Samaliya vanatambula lizi lia Njambi, nankuma, vavatuminine Petulu na Yiuano ku Samaliya. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Omo vahete kuje, vakalombelelele vaje vaka kutsiliela linga vatambule Cimbembesi Uakulela, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />muomu Cimbembesi Uakulela tele kanda eje muli vakevo, vuno honi vavambuitikile lika mu lizina lia Muene Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Ambahoni Petulu na Yiuano vasalekele mavoko avo hali vakevo, kaha vatambuile Cimbembesi Uakulela.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Omo Simoni uamuene nguendi tunganda vanahana Cimbembesi kuli vaka kutsiliela mukusaleka mavoko avo hali vakevo, nankuma uahanene vimbongo kuli Petulu na Yiuano <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nange naua njihaneniko eyi nzili yakama linga uoshe injikasaleka mavoko ange akatambule Cimbembesi Uakulela.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Vuno honi Petulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yove na vimbongo viove munonge hamo, muomu yove uayongola nguove hamo uasa kulanda vuana vua Njambi na vimbongo! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Yove kuuesi na mutambela cipue cihela mu vipangi vietu, muomu mutima uove kuuesi muacili ku mesho a Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Nankuma, tenguluka linga uhume ku viyongola viove via vipi, kaha lomba kuli Muene linga akusambese ku viyongola viove evi. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Muomu njinamono nguange yove unashulu na cipululu cacipi naua unapu u cinzinda ca vupi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Kaha Simoni uahandekele kuli Petulu na Yiuano nguendi, “Njilombeleleniko kuli Muene linga viuma evi vimunahandeka keti vikanjilingiuile.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Omo vamanusuile kuhana vukaleho vuavo nakuambulula muzimbu ua Muene, Petulu na Yiuano vahilukile ku Yelusalema. Mu ngila yavo vakele nakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili mu membo amengi a mu Samaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipu na nguvulu ua ku Isopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Kaha kangelo ua Muene uahandekele kuli Filipu nguendi, “Katuka uye ku mbuela ngila ije ihuma ku Yelusalema iya ku Ngaza.” (Ngila eyi yapua ya mu mpambo) <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Nankuma, Filipu uakatukile nakuya kaha ualiuanene na kayunuke uje uapuile Kaisopiya, ikeye uapuile mukuluntu ua vulemu muka kuniunga vufuko vuoshe vua Kandeke lisano ua ku Isopiya. Ou yala uayile laja ku Yelusalema nakulemesa Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Omo uahilukile kuimbo uatumamene mu litemba liendi nakutanda livulu lia kananguizi Isaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Kaha Cimbembesi Uakulela uahandekele kuli Filipu nguendi, “Shuena kuyehi na litemba lije.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Nankuma, Filipu uashatukilileko kaha uamuvuile ali nakutanda mu livulu lia kananguizi Isaya. Kaha uamuhuile nguendi, “Nkuma ulinakuvuisisa evi ulinakutanda ndi?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Uje mukuluntu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Nkuma vatihoni njasa kuvivuisisa kuvanga umo anjilumbuininevio?” Kaha ualombele Filipu linga alonde nakutumama hamo nendi mu litemba. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Kaha mezi amu visoneka atandele uje yala akeuo aua:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Uapuile ngue mpanga uje vatuala nakumutsiha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Ngue muna mpanga uje aholoka kuluu kuli vaka kumutehula.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Mukemo vene muaholokelele na ikeye.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Vamukehesele, kaha kuva musompelele vusunga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Nkuma iya asa kuambulula ntanga yendi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Muomu muono uendi vauhumisile hano ha mavu.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Kaha uje Kayunuke uehuile Filipu nguendi, “Njileke, nkuma iya yanatumbula kananguizi, ikeye vavenia indi mukuavo ueka?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Ambahoni Filipu uaputukile kuhandeka na visoneka evi, uamulekele Muzimbu Uacili ua Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Kaha omo vakele nakuenda mu ngila, vahetele ku mutambela umo kuje kuakele mema, kaha uje Kayunuke uahandekele nguendi, “Tala mema aua! Nkuma vika naua vihonouesa kunjimbuitika?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Citava kukumbuitika nga unatsiliela na mutima uove uoshe.” Ikeye uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Muavusunga vene njitsiliela nguange Yesu Kilistu ikeye Muna Njambi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Kaha uje Kayunuke uashikile linga vemike litemba, kaha voshe vavali, Filipu na uje Kayunuke vakovelele mu mema, kaha Filipu uamumbuitikile. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Omo vahumine mu mema, Cimbembesi ua Muene uatualele Filipu kueka. Kaha uje Kayunuke kamumuene naua, vuno honi uayile vungezi vuendi nakuvuahelela cikuma. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Vuno honi Filipu ualiuanene ikeye vavenia ali ku Azotase, kaha uayile ku Sesaliya, mu ngila muoshe uayile nakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili mu vinganda vioshe.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Saulu atsiliela muli Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Vilinga 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Ha ntsimbu ijevene Saulu uakele navutenu vuakutonda kutsiha vandongisi va Muene, uayile kuli kasasendote uakama, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />nakumulomba mikanda ya ku vinjivo via malombelo vije viakele ku Ndamasika, linga nga akauanako vamo vakundama ku Ngila ya Yesu, vampuevo cipue vamala, akavakuate nakuvatuala ku Yelusalema.<verse eid="ACT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Omo Saulu uahetele kuyehi na nganda ya Ndamasika, vuasi vuasi ceke cahumine muilu nakutuila hali ikeye nakumuzengeleka. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Uauililile ha mavu kaha uovuile lizi lihandeka kuli ikeye ngualio, “Saulu, Saulu, nkuma vika ulinakunjiyandesela?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Kaha Saulu uehuile nguendi, “Nkuma yove iya, Muene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Kaha lizi liakumbuluile ngualio, “Yange Yesu, uje ulinakuyandesa. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Vuno honi katuka uye mu nganda, kaha vakakuleka viunapande kulinga.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Vamala vaje vendele hamo na Saulu vemanene kuakuhona kuhandeka muomu vovuile lika lizi vuno honi kuvamuene muntu cipue umo uje ahandeka. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Saulu uakatukile ha mavu kaha uemukile mesho endi vuno honi kamuene cuma cimo. Nankuma, vamukuatele ku livoko nakumutuala ku Ndamasika. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Kasele kumona ha matangua atatu, kaha kalile cipue kunua cuma cimo.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Mu Ndamasika muakele ndongisi ua Njambi lizina liendi Ananiyasi. Uamuene cimona cije Muene uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Ananiyasi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Kaha ikeye uakumbuluile nguendi, “Yange uno Muene.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Kaha Muene uamulekele nguendi, “Katuka uye ku ngila ije ivatumbula Kusungama ku njivo ya Yundasa ukehuleko yala nahumu ku Tasisi lizina liendi Saulu. Muomu ha ntsimbu inovene alinakulombela, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />kaha mu cimona cendi namono yala umo lizina liendi Ananiyasi neja nakumusaleka mavoko endi linga ase kumona naua.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Vuno honi Ananiyasi uakumbuluile nguendi, “Muene, njinevu viou yala ku vantu vavengi, na viuma viavingi via vipi vianalingi ku vantu vove vakulela mu Yelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Kaha neja kuno na nzili yakama yakuhuma ku vakuluntu va vasasendote mukukuata voshe vaje valemesa lizina liove.”<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Vuno honi Muene uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Ya, muomu njinamuhangula linga anjipangele mukusholola lizina liange kuli vaje keti Vayunda na kuli vimiene na ku vantu Vaisaleli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Yange vavenia njikamuleka muje muanapande kuyanda muomu ya lizina liange.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Nankuma, Ananiyasi uayile nakukovela mu njivo kaha uasalekele mavoko endi hali Saulu nakuhandeka nguendi, “Muanetu Saulu, Muene Yesu uje uasholokele kuli yove mu ngila omo uakele nakuija kuno, nanjitumu linga uase kumona naua kaha ushule na Cimbembesi Uakulela.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Hajevene viuma viakufua ngue mavanda viahumine ha mesho endi, kaha uasele kumona naua. Ambahoni uakatukile kaha vamumbuitikile, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />kaha munima yakulia viakulia, uakele na nzili naua.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Saulu ambulula mu Ndamasika</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Saulu uakele matangua amandende lika na vandongisi mu Ndamasika. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Hajevene uayile ku vinjivo via malombelo via Vayunda nakukaputuka kuambulula nguendi Yesu ikeye Muna Njambi.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Voshe vaje vamuvuile valikomokelele nakuihula nguavo, “Nkuma ou keti ikeye uje yala uakele mu Yelusalema uje uakele nakutsiha voshe vaje valemesele lizina eli ndi? Kaha nkuma kezile kuno mukukuata vaje vantu linga avatuale ku vakuluntu va vasasendote ndi?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Saulu uakele na nzili cikuma, uapayesele Vayunda vaje vakele mu Ndamasika mukuvaleka vusunga nguendi Yesu ikeye Kilistu.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Omo kuahitile matangua amengi, Vayunda valikunguluile hamo nakutumba vutumbe vuakutsiha Saulu, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />vuno honi Saulu uazivukile via vutumbe vuavo. Mutania na vutsiki vakele nakuniunga ku vikolo via ku nganda linga vamutsihe. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Vuno honi vutsiki vumo vandongisi vendi vamuhakele mu mutonga nakumusosela hambanza lia civumbe mu njanena.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saulu mu Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Omo Saulu uayile ku Yelusalema uesekele kulipandakana hamo na vandongisi, vuno honi voshe vamuteuele muomu kuvatsilielele nguavo ikeye napu ndongisi. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Vuno honi Mbanambase uamuambatele nakumutuala kuli tunganda. Uavalumbunuinine muje Saulu uamuene Muene ha ngila na muje Muene uahandekele kuli ikeye. Kaha naua uavalekele kusimpa ca Saulu omo uambuluile mu lizina lia Yesu mu Ndamasika. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Nankuma, Saulu uatumamene hamo navo kaha uahitanganene mu Yelusalema muoshe nakuambulula mu lizina lia Muene nakusimpa. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Uahandekele nakuliluisa na Vayunda vaje vakele nakuhandeka Cingelengu, vuno honi vatondele kumutsiha. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Omo vaka kutsiliela vovuile evi, vatualele Saulu ku Sesaliya nakumutuma ku Tasisi.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Nankuma, vaka kutsiliela voshe mu Yundeya na mu Ngalileya na mu Samaliya vakele na ntsimbu ya ciyulo. Hakukuasa ca Cimbembesi Uakulela vikungulukilo viakolele nakulivuezelela, ngue hakuyoya cavo kuakuvuila Muene liova.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu ali mu Linda na mu Yopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Petulu uendanganene noku noku, kaha ha ntsimbu imo uayile nakumona vaka kutsiliela vaje vakele mu Linda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Kuje uakauanene yala umo lizina liendi Eneyase uje uapuile muka kalepa kasele kuhuma ha citala tala ha miaka itanu na itatu. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Petulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Eneyase, Yesu Kilistu akukanguise. Katuka jandula citala tala cove.” Hajevene Eneyase uakatukile. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Vantu voshe vamu Linda na mu Shalone vaje vamumuene vatengulukilile kuli Muene.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulu asangula Ndokasi ku vatsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Mu Yopa muakele ndongisi uampuevo lizina liendi Tambita, (mu Cingelengu ikeye Ndokasi, kulumbununa “Ntsonge”) ntsimbu yoshe uakele nakulinga viacili nakukuasa vihutu. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Ha ntsimbu ijevene uavavalele, kaha uatsile. Vatanesele muvila uendi nakuulangeka ku mulili ua helu lia njivo. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Linda yakele kuyehi na Yopa, kaha omo vandongisi vaje vakele mu Yopa vovuile nguavo Petulu ali mu Linda vatumine vamala vavali kuli ikeye nguavo, “Muene, unapande kuija vuasi kuno kuli yetu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Nankuma, Petulu uakatukile nakuya navo. Omo uahetele kuje vamutualele ku mulili uahelu kuje vantuluue voshe vamuzengelekele nakulila nakumumuesa tuzaku na vikovelo vije vialingile Ndokasi ha ntsimbu ije yakele navo. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petulu uavahumisilemo voshe muje mu mulili, kaha uatsikamene ha mavu nakulombela, ambahoni uatengulukilile ku civimbi ca Ndokasi nakuhandeka nguendi, “Tambita, hinduka!” Kaha uemukile, omo uamuene Petulu, uahindukile na kutumama. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petulu uamukuatele ku livoko nakumuimika. Ambahoni uasanene vaka kutsiliela voshe na vaje vantuluue, kaha uavahaneneye oku alinakuyoya. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Muzimbu ou uashandokelele mu Yopa muoshe, kaha vantu vavengi vatsilielelele kuli Muene. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Kaha Petulu uakele mu Yopa ntsimbu yalaha hamo na Simoni muka kufutungula vilambu.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Petulu na Koneliasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Kuakele yala umo mu Sesaliya lizina liendi Koneliasi, uje uapuile ntuama ua masualale Valoma cihita cimo (100) vaje vavatumbuile nguavo, “Civunga ca masualale va Itali.” <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Uapuile yala uavakakulemesa Njambi uakuvuila Njambi liova hamo na ntanga yendi yoshe. Naua uakele nakukuasa cikuma vantu vakuhutua, kaha ntsimbu yoshe uakele nakulombela kuli Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Ha litangua limo tele ha ntsimbu ya mucitatu ya mutania ua cinguezi, uakele nacimona cije muamuene muacili kangelo ua Njambi uezile nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, “Koneliasi!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Uatalele kuli kangelo na liova nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nkuma vika Muene?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Kangelo uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Njambi navuluka malombelo ove na vipangi viove viacili. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Kaha honi tuma vamala vaye ku Yopa kuli yala umo Simoni ivatumbula Petulu kaha vamunehe kuno. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Ikeye napu mungezi mu njivo ya Simoni uje muka kufutungula vilambu, njivo yendi ili kuyehi na cisali.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Omo uje kangelo yakele nakuhandeka nendi uayile, kaha Koneliasi uasanene vangamba vendi vavali na lisualale uje uapuile uavaka kulemesa Njambi, umo uavaje vakele nakumupangela. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Hanima yakuvaleka vioshe, uavatumine ku Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Liamukuavo, omo vakele mu ngila nakuya ku Yopa, kaha Petulu uayile ha ntsimba lia njivo nakulombela tele litangua lili hakati ka mutue. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Uevuile njala kaha uakele nakutonda viakulia, tele vacili nakuvuahesa viakulia, uakele nacimona. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Uamuene lilu liashokoloka na cuma cimo cakulifua ngue ntanga yakama ije yazezumukilile ha mavu yakukuta ku vimbango viuana via lifuti. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mukati kayo muakale miyati yoshe ya tusitu, na tusitu vakulikoka ha mavu na tuzila. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Kaha uevuile lizi ngualio, “Katuka Petulu, tsiha kaha alia.”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Vuno honi Petulu uahandekele nguendi, “Houe Muene, muomu kanda njicilieho cuma cimo cakujuala cipue cakuhona kulela.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Kaha lizi liahandekele kuli ikeye naua ntsimbu ya mucivali ngualio, “Keti utumbule nguove via kuhona kulela vije Njambi nalelesa. <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Eci calingiuile ha vintsimbu vitatu, kaha ije ntanga vaihiluisile naua muilu.”<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Tele Petulu alinakusinganienga hali cije cimona mucinalumbunukila, vamala vaje vavatumine kuhuma kuli Koneliasi vehuile ku njivo ya Simoni kaha vemanene ku cikolo. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Vehuile nguavo, “Nkuma kuli mungezi kuno uje ivatumbula nguavo Simoni Petulu ndi?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Tele Petulu ali nakusinganieka cimona, Cimbembesi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Tala, vamala vatatu vali nakukutonda. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Katuka sikumuka ha mavu, linga ukaye navo cakuhona kulisindiya, muomu yange njavatumu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Kaha Petulu uasikumukile ha mavu kuli vaje vamala nakuhandeka nguendi, “Yange uno muli nakutonda. Nkuma vika munezila kuno?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Koneliasi ntuama ua masualale cihita cimo (100) ikeye natutumu kuno. Ikeye uapua yala ua vusunga nakulemesa Njambi, kaha naua Vayunda voshe vaka musingimika cikuma. Kaha kangelo uakulela ua Njambi uamulekele linga akulanie uye ku njivo yendi ngeci akevuilile vije viukahandeka.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Nankuma Petulu ualaniene vaje vamala linga vakose mu njivo yendi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Kaha liamukuavo uayile hamo navo, navamo vaka kutsiliela vaje vahumine ku Yopa vayile hamo nendi. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Kaha liamukuavo vahete ku Sesaliya, kuje Koneliasi uakele nakuvavandamena, hamo navavushoko na vavusamba vendi vaje valaniene. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Hakuheta ca Petulu, Koneliasi uamusheshele nakuua ku viliato viendi nakumulemesa. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Vuno honi Petulu uamukatuile nakuhandeka nguendi, “Katuka njinapu nji muntu lika.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Kaha omo uakele nakuhandeka nendi, uakovelele mu njivo kaha uauanene vantu vavengi valikungulula hamo. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni munazivuka ngueni Kayunda Lishiko liendi kulitavesa kulimenekele na kukala hamo nava keti Vayunda. Vuno honi Njambi nanjimuesa ngeci yange keti njiyongole muntu umo nguange uakujuala cipue uakuhona kulela. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Nankuma omo muanjisanene, njinezile kuakuhona vimpata. Kaha honi njihula nkuma vika muanjisanenena.”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koneliasi uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yapuile ngue ntsimbu ino vene tele munahiti matangua auana omo njakele na kulombela mu njivo yange ha ntsimbu ya mucitatu ya cinguezi. Kaha hajevene yala umo uazalele vuzalo viakuviakuma uemanene kulutue luange. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Kaha uahandekele nguendi, ‘Koneliasi lilombelo liove vanalivu na vipangi viove viakukuasa vihutu vana vavuluka kuli Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Tuma umo ku Yopa linga akasane yala umo lizina liendi Simoni ivatumbula Petulu. Napu mungezi ku njivo ya Simoni uje muka kufutungula vilambu uje uakala kungenge ya cisali.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Nankuma, njakusanene vuasi vuasi, kaha unavuahesa omo uneja. Kaha tuva voshe tuli kuno ku mesho a Njambi nakuivuilila vije Muene nakushiki kuhandeka.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuambulula ca Petulu mu njivo ya Koneliasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Ambahoni Petulu uaputukile kuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Muavusunga njinevuisisa nguange Njambi kekuyengula. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Vaje voshe vamuteua nakulinga vije viacili navatambula, kakatala ku muyati ua vantu. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Muazivuka muzimbu uatumine kuli Vaisaleli, uje uakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua ciyulo kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu, Muene ua voshe. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Uje muzimbu uashandokelele mu Yundeya, uaputukilile mu Ngalileya munima ya Yiuano ha kuambulula kumbuitika ca kutenguluka. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Muje Njambi uavuavesele Yesu uaku Nazaleta na Cimbembesi Uakulela na nzili. Uakele nakuya kuoshe nakupanga viacili nakukanguisa vaje voshe vakele na nzili ya Liyavolo, muomu Njambi uakele hamo nendi. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Tuvakaleho kuvije vioshe vialingiuile mu Yundeya namu Yelusalema. Kaha vamutsihile mukumushukika ha cilindakano. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Vuno honi Njambi uamusanguile ku vatsi ha litangua lia mu citatu na kumutavesa linga alisholole, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />keti ku vantu voshe vuno honi kuli yetu lika vaje vahanguile Njambi kupua vakaleho vendi, yetu vaje valile nendi na kunua nendi hanima yakusanguka ku vatsi. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Uatushikile kuambulula ku vantu na kuambulula vukaleho ngeci Njambi namuhangula kupua muka kuyula uavaka kuyoya na vatsi. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Kaha tunanguizi voshe va Njambi vakahana vukaleho nguavo uoshe uje akatsiliela muli ikeye vakamukonekela ku vipi viendi kuhitila muli lizina liendi.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaje keti Vayunda vatambula Cimbembesi Uakulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Tele Petulu uakele nakuhandeka, Cimbembesi Uakulela uezile hali voshe vaje vovuile muzimbu. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Kaha Vayunda vaka kutsiliela vaje vezile na Petulu kuhuma ku Yopa valikomokelele cikuma hakumona vuana vua Cimbembesi Uakulela vanavuhana cipue kuli vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Muomu vevuile vali nakuhandeka mu vindaka viakuliseza seza nakulemesa vukama vua Njambi, ambahoni Petulu uahandekele nguendi, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Ava vantu vanatambula Cimbembesi Uakulela, ngue muje yetu tuamutambuile. Nkuma kuli umo asa kuvavindika kuvambuitika ku mema ndi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Nankuma uavashikile linga vavambuitike mu lizina lia Yesu Kilistu. Kaha vamulombele linga akale navo matangua amandende lika.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Vukaleho vua Petulu ku cikungulukilo mu Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Kaha Tunganda na vaka kutsiliela vaje vakele mu Yundeya vovuile nguavo vaje keti Vayunda navakevo vanatambula lizi lia Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Omo Petulu uayile ku Yelusalema, vaje keti Vayunda vaje vauanene kavumbi ha kulovoka vamuluisile, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma vika unayila kuli ava keti Vayunda vakuhona kulovoka nakulia navo?” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Kaha Petulu uaputukile kuvalumbunuina kuputukila hambangelo nguendi,<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Omo tele njakele nakulombela mu nganda ya Yopa, njamuene cimona. Njamuene cimo cezile ha mavu cakulifua ngue ntanga yakama yakukuta ku vimbango viuana kuhuminina muilu, kaha yatulilile kuyehi nange. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Omo njatalele cikuma mukati kayo njamuene tusitu va muimbo na vamu musenge, na tusitu vakulikoka ha mavu, na tuzila. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Kaha njevuile lizi lihandeka kuli yange ngualio, ‘Katuka Petulu, tsiha kaha ulie!’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Vuno honi njakumbuluile nguange, ‘Houe Muene, muomu kanda njicilieho cuma cimo cakujuala cipue cakuhona kulela.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Kaha lizi liahandekele kuli yange naua ntsimbu ya mu civali kuhuminina muilu ngualio, ‘Vije Njambi nalelesa, keti uvitumbule nguove viakuhona kulela.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Eci calingiuile ha vintsimbu vitatu, kaha ije ntanga na vioshe vije viakeleho vavihiluisile muilu naua. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Kaha hajevene vamala vatatu vaje vavatumine kuli yange kuhuminina ku Seseliya vahetele ku njivo kuje kunjakele. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Cimbembesi uanjilekele nguendi njiye navo kuakuhona kulisindiya. Ava vamuanetu vatanu na umo vaka kutsiliela vayile hamo nange ku Seseliya, kaha tuva voshe tuakovelele hamo mu njivo ya Koneliasi. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Uatulekele muje mua muenenenemo kangelo uje uemanene mu njivo yendi nakuhandeka nguendi, ‘Tuma vantu ku Yopa vakasane Simoni, uje ivatumbula Petulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Akamihana muzimbu uje yove na ntanga yove yoshe mukovokelamo.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Omo njaputukile kuhandeka, Cimbembesi Uakulela uakele hali vakevo ngue muje muakele hali yetu hambangelo. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Nankuma njili nakuvuluka lizi liahandekele Muene nguendi, ‘Yiuano uambuitikile na mema, vuno honi yeni vakamimbuitika na Cimbembesi Uakulela.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Nga Njambi avahanene vuana vuakulifua ngue vuje vua tuhanene omo tuatsilielele muli Muene Yesu Kilistu, nkuma yange iya honi linga njivianese Njambi?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Kaha omo vovuile vije viahandekele, vecelele kumuluisa kaha vaputukile kulemesa Njambi nakuhandeka nguavo, “Nkuma Njambi nahana ntsimbu kuli ava keti Vayunda linga vatenguluke naku yoya ndi.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikungulukilo ca ku Antioke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Vaka kutsiliela vaje valishandokele ha mapakeso na ha ntsimbu ije ivatsihile Setefano vayile kulahako, vayile ku Fonisiya na ku Sepulasi na ku Antioke nakuambulula lizi kuli Vayunda lika. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Vuno honi vaka kutsiliela vakuavo vaje vahuminine ku Sepulasi naku Silene vayile ku Antioke kaha naua vayile nakuambulula muzimbu ku Vangelengu, nakuvalekesa Muzimbu Uacili ua Muene Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Nzili ya Muene yakele hamo navo, kaha vantu vavengi vatengulukile na kutsiliela muli Muene.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Muzimbu uoshe uahetele ku cikungulukilo ca mu Yelusalema, kaha vatumine Mbanambase ku Antioke. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Omo uezile uamuene kavumbi ka Njambi muje muka nakuisula vantu, uavuahelelele kaha uavalambelelele ngeci vapue vaka kukonkama na vusunga kuli Muene na mitima yavo yoshe. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Mbanambase uapuile yala uacili uakushula na Cimbembesi Uakulela na lutsilielo, kaha na vantu vavengi vezile kuli Muene.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Kaha Mbanambase uayile ku Tasisi mukutonda Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Kaha omo uamuuanene uamutualele ku Antioke, ha muaka uoshe uamutuntu ava vavali valiuanene na vantu va mu cikungulukilo nakulongesa civunga cakama kaha ku Antioke kuje Vandongisi vaputukile kuvahandeka nguavo vaka Kilistu.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Ha ntsimbu ije tunanguizi vahumine ku Yelusalema vasikumukile ku Antioke. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Umo uavo ua lizina lia Angambase uemanene na nzili ya Cimbembesi nakuhandeka vije vikalingiua kulutue nguendi njala yakama ilinakuija hano ha mavu oshe a vaka Loma (kaha eci calingiuile omo Kalaundiase uapuile Sezale) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Nankuma vandongisi vasinganiekele ngeci umo na umo hakati kavo akatume vukuasi ngue muanasela mukukuasa vakuavo vaka kutsiliela vaje vakele mu Yundeya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Kaha valingile cuma eci, vahanene vimbongo kuli Mbanambase na Saulu ngeci vavituale ku vakuluntu va cikungulukilo.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Mapakeso amengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Kaha ha ntsimbu ije vene muene Helonde uaputukile kupakesa vaka cikungulukilo. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Uatsihile Yakomba munaina ya Yiuano, namukuale. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Kaha omo uamuene ngeci navuahelesa Vayunda, kaha uatualeleho lutue kukuta Petulu. (Eci calingiuile ha ntsimbu ya ciuano ca Mbolo yakuhona cimbaluila) <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Kaha omo uamukutile uamuhakele mu kamenga, kaha vamuhanene ku vivunga via masualale viuana muje muakele vauana mu civunga cimo na cimo linga vamuniunge. Helonde uatondele kumusompesela ha civunga ca vantu omo ciuano ca Paseka nga cinahu. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Tele Petulu acili mu kamenga, cikungulukilo cakele nakumulombelela kuli Njambi.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kangelo ahumisa Petulu mu kamenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Vutsiki vujevene ntsimbu Helonde kanda a mutuale muku musompa, Petulu uakosele mukati kavaje vakele nakumuniunga vavali. Vamukutile na malienge avali, kaha kuakele masualale ku cikolo vaje vakele nakuniunga. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Hajevene kangelo ua Muene uasholokele kaha na ceke catuila mu kamenga, ambahoni uje kangelo uaningangele Petulu nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, “Katuka vuasi.” Kaha hajevene malienge aje akele ku mavoko endi azitukile. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Kaha kangelo uahandekele naua kuli ikeye nguendi, “Kuta muiva uove kaha zala na vinkaku viove.” Petulu ualingile muje mua mulekelelemo, kaha kangelo uahandekele naua nguendi, “Zala cikovelo cove kaha njikave.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Kaha Petulu uamukavangeyele hambanza lia kamenga, vuno honi kazivukile nguendi vije viakele nakulinga kangelo viapuile via vusunga, uasinganiekele nguendi hamo ali nakumona lika cimona. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Omo vapulakanene civunga ca masualale ca kulivanga na cije ca mucivali, kaha vahetele ku cikolo ca cikuvo cije cakuya mu nganda. Kaha cikolo calishokolokelele cikeco vavenia, kaha vatuhukile hambanza. Vendele hamo mu tapalo kaha hajevene kangelo uamusezele Petulu.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Petulu uasinganiekele hali vije vialingiuile kuli ikeye kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Hano honi njazivuka muavusunga ngeci Muene natumu kangelo uendi linga anjovole ku nzili ya Helonde naku vioshe vije Vayunda vasinganiekele nguavo vikalingiua.”<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Omo uazivukile vioshe vije via lingiuile, uayile ku njivo ya Maliya vaina ya Yiuano uje ivatumbuile Mako, kuje ku vakungulukilile vantu vavengi nakulombela. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Kaha Petulu uatotele ha cikolo ca hambanza, kaha ngamba umo ua mpuevo ua lizina lia Londa uezile nakumutava. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Uazivukile lizi lia Petulu kaha uavuahelele cikuma, uahilukile kuli vakevo cakuhona kushokolola cikolo nakuhandeka nguendi, “Petulu nemana ku cikolo hambaza.” <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Kaha voshe vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Uzaluka!” Kaha uavasindiyile nguendi njimileka vusunga. Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Mpamo napu kangelo uendi.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Vuno honi Petulu uatualeleho kutota ha cikolo, kaha omo vashokoluele ku cikolo vamumuene kaha valikomokelele cikuma. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Vuno honi uavaniatelele na livoko liendi linga vaholoke kuluu, kaha uavalekele muje vati Muene na muhumisilamo mu kamenga nguendi, “Lekeni evi kuli Yakomba na vaka kutsiliela.” Ambahoni uavasezele nakuya ku mutambela ueka.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Kaha omo kuacele cimene kuakele citanga cikuma hakati ka masualale vaje vaka kuniunga kamenga, hali vije vialingiuile kuli Petulu. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Helonde uavashikile linga vamutonde vuno honi kuvamuuanene, uehozuele vaje vaka kuniunga kaha uashikile linga vavatsihe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Hanima yevi Helonde uahumine mu Yundeya na kuya ku Sesaliya, nakukalako.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsa ca Helonde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Honi Helonde uanienguelele cikuma vantu vaku Tile na Kusindone. Kaha civunga cakama caile nakumumona. Ha kulivanga valambelele Mbalasitase muka kuniunga lipela ngeci avakuase. Ambahoni vayile kuli Helonde nakumulomba ngeci kukale ciyulo, muomu cifuti cavo cakele nakutambula via kulia via kuhuma ku cifuti ca muene.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Ha litangua lia kuhangula, Helonde uazalele tuzaku tuendi tua vumuene nakutumama ha litanda liendi nakuhandeka ku vantu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Vatambakanene cikuma nguavo, “Keti lizi lia muntu lihandeka vuno honi lizi lia njambi!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Hajevene kangelo ua Muene uapupile Helonde, muomu kahanene kasingimiko kuli Njambi. Kaha mavuno amulile, kaha uatsile.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Vuno honi lizi lia Njambi liatualeleho kuya lutue.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Omo Mbanambase na Saulu vamanusuile vipangi viavo vahilukile ku Yelusalema hamo na Yiuano, uje ivatumbuile naua nguavo Mako.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Mbanambase na Saulu vavahangula na kuvatuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Honi mu cikungulukilo ku Antioke kuakele tunanguizi na valongisi, vaje vapuile Mbanambase na Simioni (uje ivatumbuile nguavo uaku Zivala), na Luyasi (uje uahumine ku Silene) na Manane, (Uje ivalelele hamo na Nguvulu Helonde) na Saulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Omo vakele nakulemesa Muene nakuliumina via kulia, Cimbembesi Uakulela uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Njitepeseleniko Mbanambase na Saulu linga vapange vipangi vije njavasanena.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Hanima yakuliumina via kulia na kulombela, nakuvasaleka mavoko kaha vavatumine.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbanambase na Saulu vambulula mu Sapulasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Omo Cimbembesi Uakulela uatumine Mbanambase na Saulu vaye ku Seleusiya, kaha hakuhuma kuje vasikumukile mu vuato ku nkundu ya Sepulasi. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Omo vahetele ku Salamisi vaputukile kuambulula lizi lia Njambi mu vinjivo via malombelo. Kaha Yiuano uakele hamo navo mukuvakuasa vipangi.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Vendele mu nkundu muoshe nakuheta ku Pafose kuje vakauanene umo muka mantseno lizina liendi Mbala-Yesu, ikeye Kayunda uje ualitumbuile ikeye vavenia kupua kananguizi ua makuli. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Uapuile kavusamba kauje mukuluntu uamuje mu nkundu lizina liendi Selengiyase Pauluse, uje uapuile yala uamangana. Nguvulu ua Loma uasanene Mbanambase na Saulu muomu uatondele kuivua lizi lia Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Vuno honi vakele nakuvaluisa kuli muka mantseno Eliamase (eli likelio lizina liendi lia Cingelengu), uje uesekele kuhumisa Nguvulu ku lutsilielo. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Vuno honi Saulu uje ivatumbuile nguavo Paulu uashulile na Cimbembesi Uakulela, uatalele uje muka mantseno ntooma, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />nakuhandeka nguendi, “Yove muna Liyavolo, yove citozi ca vusunga, uakushula na makuli oshe na lizangamena lioshe, kaha yove ntsimbu yoshe uli nakueseka kutengulula vusunga vua Muene kuvupuisa makuli. <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Muene akakuluisa, kaha ukapua kapuputua muka ntsimbu lika, kukamono kutua ca litangua.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Kaha hajevene mbundu na milima viezile ha mesho endi kaha uahonouele kumona, uaputukile kutonda muntu linga amukuate ku livoko. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Kaha omo Nguvulu uavimuene vije via lingiuile uatsilielele, muomu ualikomokelele cikuma ha vilongesa via Muene.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu na Mbanambase vali mu Antioke ya mu Pisindiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Paulu na vakuavo vajavukile mu vuato kuya musinia lia Pafose, kaha vezile ku Pelenga nganda ya mu Pamefiliya, kaha Yiuano uavasezele uahilukile ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Vahumine ku Pelenga vahetele ku Antioke mu Pisindiya, kaha lia Sapalalo vayile mu njivo ya malombelo naku katumamamo. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Hanima yakutanda Lishiko lia Mosesa na visoneka via tunanguizi kaha vantuama va mu njivo ya malombelo vatumine lizi kuli vakevo nguavo, “Vamuanetu tumilomba nguetu muhandeke ku vantu nga muli na mezi akuvakolesa.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Nankuma Paulu uemanene na kuolola livoko liendi muilu nakuhandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Vamuanetu vaka Isaleli neni keti Vayunda vaka kulemesa Njambi, ivuilileni kuli yange! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Njambi ua vantu Vaisaleli uahanguile vakukuluila vetu, nakuvapuisa muyati uakama ha ntsimbu ije vakele vangenzi mu Ingito. Kaha Njambi uavahumisile mu Ingito na nzili yendi yakama, <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />kaha uavaniungile mu mpambo ha miaka yakupua makumi auana. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Uanongesele mafuti a miyati itanu na ivali mu cifuti ca Kanana, kaha uapuisile cifuti cije vusuana vua vantu vendi. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Kaha evi viuma vioshe via lingiuile ha miaka yakusetekesa vihita viuana na makumi atanu (450)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Kaha hanima yevi uavahanene mahako noho ha ntsimbu ya kananguizi Samuele. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Ambahoni valombele muene, kaha Njambi uavahanene Saulu muna Kishe, uaku muyati ua Mbenjemani, ngeci apue muene uavo ha miaka makumi auana (40) <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Kaha omo Njambi uahumisile Saulu ha vumuene, uapuisile Ndaviti muene uavo. Eci cikeco cahandekele Njambi hali ikeye nguendi, ‘Njinauana Ndaviti muna Njesi ikeye yala uje injazanga, uje akalinga vioshe vije njitonda ngeci avilinge.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Ikeye Yesu uaku ntanga ya Ndaviti uje Njambi uamupuisile Muyoyesi ua vantu Vaisaleli ngue muje muakulahesele laja. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Ntsimbu kanda Yesu aputuke vipangi viendi, Yiuano uambuluile ku vantu voshe Vaisaleli ngeci vatenguluke ku vupi vuavo nakuvambuitika. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Kaha omo Yiuano uahetele muyehi nakumanesa vipangi viendi, uehuile vantu nguendi, ‘Nkuma musinganieka ngueni Yange iya? Keti yange uje muli na kuvandamena. Vuno honi ivuilileni! Alinakuija munima yange, yange kunjasa cipue kuzitula miva ya vinkaku viendi.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Vamuanetu vaka Isaleli vatekuluila va Avilahama, kaha neni voshe keti Vayunda yeni mulikuno vaka kulemesa Njambi: muzimbu ou uakuovoka vanautumu kuli yetu! <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Muomu vantu vaje valinakuyoya mu Yelusalema na vantuama vavo kuvazivukile ngeci ikeye napu Muyoyesi, cipue kuvuisisa mezi a tunanguizi aje avakatanda ha litangua na litangua lioshe lia Sapalalo, cipue ngoco valingisile mezi a tunanguizi kupua a vusunga mukuhisa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Cipue ngocovene kuvauanene vukaleho ngeci vamuhisile kutsa, vuno honi valombele Pilato linga amutsihe. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Kaha omo valingile vioshe vije ngue muviahandeka visoneka hali ikeye, vamuhumisile ha cilindakano na kumuhaka mu cihilo. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Vuno honi Njambi uamusanguile ku vatsi, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />kaha ha matangua amengi ualisholuele kuli vaje uendele navo kuhuma ku Ngalileya nakuheta ku Yelusalema. Vakevo honi vanapu vakaleho vendi ku vantu Vaisaleli. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Yetu tulikuno naku minehela Muzimbu Uacili, uje Njambi uakulahesele vakukuluila vetu nguendi akaulinga, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />evi vikevio natulingila yetu vatekuluila vavo mukusangula Yesu ku muono ngue muvanasoneka mu livulu lia mucivali lia Miaso ngualio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Yove unapu u munange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">litangua lia lelo njinapu nji Isho.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Kaha eci cikeco cahandekele Njambi hakumusangula ku vatsi nguendi kakapolela mu cihilo houe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Njikakuhana vikuisulo via kulela via vusunga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">vije njakulahesele Ndaviti.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Ngue muanahandeka naua mu mikanda yeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Ku ukatava ngamba yove uakulela linga apolele mu cihilo.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Kaha omo Ndaviti uapangele cizango ca Njambi ha ntsimbu yendi vavenia, kaha uatsile, vamutsindile na vakukuluila vendi, kaha muvila uendi uapolele mu cihilo. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Vuno honi kuli uje yasanguile Njambi ku vatsi muvila uendi ku uapolele mu cihilo.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />“Kaha yeni voshe vamuanetu vaka Isaleli munapande kuzivuka ngeci kuhitila muli Yesu mukemuo vali nakuambulula muzimbu uaku konekela ca vipi. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Kaha munapande kuzivuka ngeci uoshe uje atsiliela muli Yesu nazituka ku vipi, kaha vanamupuisa kupua ua kupatuka ku viuma vioshe vije lishiko lia Mosesa ku liasele kumupuisa ua kupatuka. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Zangameni linga vije vivahandekele tunanguizi keti vilingiue kuli yeni.<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Taleni yeni vaka sembulule, kaha likomokeleni na kutsa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Muomu cuma cije njikalinga mu matangua eni cikapua cuma cije kumukatsiliela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">cipue nga kukala umo akamilumbunuinaco!’”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Omo Paulu na Mbanambase vahumine mu njivo ya malombelo, vantu vavalaniene naua kuhiluka kuli vakevo ha litangua lia Sapalalo likuavo nakuvaleka viuma evi. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Omo vantu vahumine kuje ku njivo ya malombelo, Vayunda vavengi na vaje keti Vayunda vaje vapuile vakulongua ku futisi ya Vayunda vakavele Paulu na Mbanambase. Kaha vahandekele kuli vakevo nakuvakolesa kukakateya ha kuyoya mu kavumbi ka Njambi.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Kaha lia Sapalalo ikuavo vantu vavandende lika vasalele mu nganda muomu voshe vezile mukuivua lizi lia Muene. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Omo Vayunda vamuene civunga, vakele nacipululu, valuisile vije viakele nakuhandeka Paulu kaha vamutukile. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Vuno honi Paulu na Mbanambase vahandekele nakusimpa nguavo, “Capandele ngue lizi lia Njambi valihandeke kuli yeni ha kulivanga. Vuno honi mualivianene, kaha munalisinganieka yeni vavenia ngueni kumuafuililile kutambula muono uayaye, kaha tumiseza nakuya kuli vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Muomu eli likelio Lishiko lianatushiki Muene nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">“‘Njinamipuisa ceke kuli ava keti Vayunda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">ngeci vaka mafuti voshe vakovoke.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Omo vaje keti Vayunda vuovuile evi, vavuahelele nakulemesa lizi lia Muene, kaha vaje vavahanguile kupua na muono uayaye vatsilielele.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Kaha lizi lia Muene liashandokelele kuoshe mu cihela cije. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Vuno honi Vayunda vashongangeyele vantuama va mu nganda, nava vampuevo vakutsimana vaje keti Vayunda vaje vakulongua vaka kulemesa Njambi. Kaha vaputukile kupakesa Paulu na Mbanambase nakuvasheka ku cihela cavo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Vuno honi tunganda vatotomuene likungu ku viliato viavo kupua cihiso ca vantu va kuje, kaha vayile ku Ikoniyame. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Kaha vandongisi vamu Antioke vashulile nakuvuahelela na Cimbembesi Uakulela.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Paulu na Mbanambase mu Ikoniyame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Cuma cimolika calingiuile mu Ikoniyame, muje Paulu na Mbanambase vayile mu njivo ya malombelo vahandekele mu ngila ije yanehesele ngeci civunga cakama ca Vayunda na Vangelengu linga vatsiliele. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Vuno honi Vayunda vaje vakakuhona kutsiliela vashongangeyele vaje keti Vayunda nakuluisa vaka kutsiliela. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Kaha Paulu na Mbanambase vakele kuje ntsimbu yalaha, vahandekele nakusimpa hali Muene, uje uasholuele ngeci muzimbu uavo ua kavumbi uapuile ua vusunga mukuvahana nzili ya kulinga vimueso na vikomoueso. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Vuno honi vantu va muje mu nganda valitepele, vamo vemanene na Vayunda, vakuavo vemanene na tunganda.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Kaha Vayunda na vaje keti Vayunda hamo na vakuluntu vavo, valitavasanene kuyandesa tunganda nakuvasha mavue. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Kaha omo tunganda vanangukile eci, vateuelele ku Lisitala na ku Ndemba vinganda via mu Likaoniya na ku mitambela yakuhatako. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Kaha kuje vambuluile Muzimbu Uacili.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu na Mbanambase mu Seseliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Mu Lisitala muakele yala umo uje uapuile cilema ua mikono hume ha kusemuka cendi kasele kuenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Uatumamene kuje nakuivua mezi a Paulu, Paulu uamuene ngeci natsiliela, kaha asa ku kanguka nankuma uamutalele ntooma. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Kaha Paulu uatambekele na lizi liakama nguendi, “Katuka uimane!” Kaha uje yala uatumbukile nakuputuka kuenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Omo civunga camuene vije vialingile Paulu, vaputukile kutambeka mu ndaka yavo ya Cilikaoniya nguavo, “Vanjambi vaneja kuli yetu mu cifua ca vuntu!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Kaha valukile Mbanambase lizina nguavo Zeyase, na Paulu nguavo Helemese, muomu ikeye uapuile mukuluntu uakuhandeka. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Kasasendote ua Zeyase uje njivo yendi yakulemesela yakele hambanza lia nganda, uanehele vangombe va vankomba na vitsani ku cikolo, muomu ikeye na vaje vivunga vatondele kukombelela nkombelo ku tunganda.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Vuno honi omo Mbanambase na Paulu vovuile vije vatondele kulinga, vatavozuele vuzalo viavo nakushatukila mukati ka civunga nakutambeka nguavo, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Nkuma vika muli nakulingila cuma eci? Netu tunapu vantu ngeci yeni! Tulikuno mukuambulula Muzimbu Uacili, nakumitengulula ku viuma viangoco ngeci muije kuli Njambi ua kuyoya, uje uatangele lilu na mavu na cisali na vioshe vije vilimo. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Ku miaka ya vakukuluila vetu uatavesele vantu voshe linga vaye mu vingila viavo vavenia. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Vuno honi ha ntsimbu ije uahanene vukaleho vuakukala cendi vavenia ha viuma via cili, kaha akamihana kalunga na vimbuto ha ntsimbu yavio, akamihana via kulia nakushulisa mitima yeni nakuvuahelela.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Cipue ngocovene na mezi aua a tunganda kuvasele kuvindika civunga kukombelela nkombelo kuli vakevo.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Vuno honi Vayunda vamo vahuminine ku Antioke mu Pisindiya naku Ikoniyame vashongangeyele vivunga kaha vashele mavue Paulu nakumukokela hambaza lia nganda omo vayonguele nguavo hamo natsi. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Vuno honi omo vandongisi vamuzengelekele, uahindukile nakuimana nakuhiluka mu nganda. Kaha liamukuavo ikeye na Mbanambase vayile ku Ndemba.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu na Mbanambase vahiluka ku Antioke mu Seseliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Omo Paulu na Mbanambase vambuluile Muzimbu Uacili mu Ndemba, kaha vanganialele vandongisi vavengi. Ambahoni vahilukile ku Lisitala na ku Ikoniyame noho vahetele ku Antioke, mu Pisindiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Paulu na Mbanambase vakolesele vandongisi nakuvatakamesa ngeci vapue vaka vusunga mukutsiliela, vavalongesele nguavo, “Tuapande kuhita mu tuyando tuatuingi ngeci tukovele mu Vumuene vua Njambi.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Mu cikungulukilo na cikungulukilo vemikilemo vakuluntu, kaha na malombelo na kuliumina kulia vavakundikile kuli Muene uje ivatsilielelele.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Kaha omo vahetele ku cihela ca Pisindiya, vezile ku Pamefiliya, <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />kuje vambuluile lizi ku Pelenga, kaha vasikumukile ku Ataliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Kaha kuhuma kuje vajavukile mu vuato nakuhiluka ku Antioke ku cihela cije vavakundikile ku kavumbi ka Njambi ku vipangi vije vivamanusuile ku linga.<verse eid="ACT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Omo vahetele mu Antioke vakunguluilile hamo vantu vaka cikungulukilo nakuvaleka viuma vije via lingile Njambi kuli vakevo, na muje mua shokololuele ngila kuli vaje keti Vayunda ngeci vatsiliele. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Kaha vakele kuje ntsimbu yalaha na vandongisi.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Vantuama va cikungulukilo valiuana mu Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Vuno honi vamala vamo vahumine ku Yundeya vayile ku Antioke vaputukile kulongesa vaka kutsiliela nguavo, “Kumuasa kuovoka kuvanga mulovoke ngue kuya ku Lishiko lia Mosesa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Kaha Paulu na Mbanambase vakele na vimpata cikuma na vakevo ha cuma eci, vasinganiekele ngeci Paulu na Mbanambase na vamo veka vantu va mu Antioke vaye ku Yelusalema nakuliuana na tunganda na vakuluntu vamu nganda ije ha cuma eci.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Nankuma, cikungulukilo ca vatumine, kaha omo vahitile mu Fonisiya na mu Samaliya, kaha valumbunuine muje vati vaje keti Vayunda vatengulukilile kuli Njambi, ou muzimbu uanehele kuvuahelela cikuma kuli vaka kutsiliela voshe. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Kaha omu vahetele mu Yelusalema, vavatambuile ku cikungulukilo, naku tunganda, naku vakuluntu, kaha valumbunuine vioshe vije vialingile Njambi kuhitila muli vakevo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Vuno honi vaka kutsiliela vamo vaje kuvakundamene ku civunga ca Vafaliseho vakatukile nakuhandeka nguavo, “Vaje keti Vayunda vanapande kulovoka nakuvaleka ngeci vononoke Lishiko lia Mosesa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Tunganda hamo na vakuluntu vakungulukile na nakusinganieka ha cuma eci. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Kaha omo vahandekele ntsimbu yalaha, Petulu uakatukile nakuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vamuanetu muazivuka hume laja Njambi uahanguile yange hakati keni na kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili kuli vaje keti Vayunda ngeci vovue na kutsiliela. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Njambi uje azivuka visinganieka via muntu uoshe, uamuesele vukaleho vuendi kuli vaje keti Vayunda hakuvahana Cimbembesi Uakulela, ngue muje muatuhanene yetu naua. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Kaha kamuesele kahangu hakati kavo netu, vuno honi uavasambesele ku vipi viavo muomu vatsilielele. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Nkuma vika muesekela Njambi nakutuika citeli ha miongo ya vandongisi cije cipue vakukuluila vetu cipue yetu kutuasa kucambata. <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Tutsiliela na kuovoka ha kavumbi ka Muene Yesu, ngue vakevo naua.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Kaha civunga coshe ca vantu vaholokele kuluu muomu vovuile Mbanambase na Paulu valumbununa vimueso na vikomoueso vije vialingile Njambi kuhitila muli vakevo kuli vaje keti Vayunda. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Omo vamanusuile kuhandeka vioshe, kaha Yakomba uahandekele nguendi, “Vamuanetu njivuilileni! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Simoni ahavene natulumbunuina muje vati Njambi ha kulivanga uahakelele mana kuli vaje keti Vayunda mukuhangulaho vamo hakati kavo ngeci vapue vantu vendi. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Mezi a tunanguizi a litombola muacili na viuma evi. Ngue muje muvihandeka visoneka nguavio,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Kaha Muene Njambi alinakuhandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Hanima ya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">viuma evi njikahiluka nakuhiluisa naua vumuene vua Ndaviti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">njikavutungulula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">nakuvukolesa naua.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Kaha vantu voshe vakeja kuli yange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">voshe vaje keti Vayunda vaje njasana kupua vange.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Kaha omu mukemuo mualinakuhandeka Muene, uje uasholuele viuma vioshe kuntsenkulu.’<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Yakomba uahandekele nguendi “Mu visinganieka viange,” nguange, “Kutuapandele kupakesa vaje keti Vayunda vaje vali nakutengulukila kuli Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Vuno honi tunapande kuvasonekela mukanda uakuvaleka nguetu keti valie viakulia via kujeneka kulela muomu vanavikombelela ku tumponia nakulitenga kuvupangala, kaha naua keti valie tusitu va kutikinia cipue kulia maninga. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kuhuma ku ntsimbu ya laja Lishiko lia Mosesa valitanda mu vinjivo via malombelo ha litangua lia Sapalalo, kaha naua mezi endi va ambulula mu vinganda vioshe.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukanda kuli vaje keti Vayunda vakutsiliela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Ambahoni tunganda na vakuluntu hamo na cikungulukilo coshe vasinganiekele kuhangula vamala ha civunga cavo ngeci vavatume ku Antioke hamo lika na Paulu na Mbanambase. Vahanguile naua vamala vavali vaje vavasingimikile cikuma vaka kutsiliela, vakevo vaje vapuile Yundasa uje ivasanene Mbalasambase na Silasi. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Kaha vavatumine hamo na mukanda uje uayile kuli vakevo uje uahandekele nguauo,</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 15:23">“Vamuanetu yetu tunganda na vakuluntu, tunatumu vihindu vietu kuli yeni voshe vamuanetu vaje keti Vayunda ku cisemua yeni vaje muakala mu Antioke, namu Siliya, namu Silisha. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Tunevu nguavo vamo vamala vamu civunga cetu vaneja na kumipakesa na nakuminienguesa na vije vivanahandeka vakevo cakuhona kutambula vilongesa viakuhuma kuli yetu. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Kaha tualikunguluile na kulitavasana tuva voshe kuhangula vamo vamala nakuvatuma kuli yeni, hamo na vavusamba vetu vatuazangele cikuma Mbanambase na Paulu, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />vaje vahanene muono uavo mukupangela Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Kaha tunatumu Yundasa na Silasi vaje vakamileka viuma vimo vije vituli na kusoneka. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Omo Cimbembesi Uakulela hamolika netu tualitavasana ngeci kutuapandele kumituika citeli ceka naua kuvanga lika mashiko aua nguetu, <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Keti mulie viakulia vije via kukombelela ku tumponia, keti munue maninga, keti mulie kasitu uakutikinia, kaha litengeni ku vupangala, mukakala muacili nga muliniunga cakuhona kulinga viuma evi, Njambi amikuisule.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Kaha vaje vavatumine vasikumukile ku Antioke kuje vakakunguluile civunga coshe ca vaka kutsiliela nakuvahana uje mukanda. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Kaha omo vantu muvatandele uje mukanda vavuahelele cikuma ha muzimbu uakuvakolesa. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Kaha Yundasa na Silasi vaje vapuile tunanguizi, va vasimpisile na kuvakolesa cikuma. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Omo vakele navo kuje mu ka ntsimbu lika, kaha vaka kutsiliela vavahiluisile mu ciyulo kuli vaje vavatumine. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />[Kaha Silasi uasinganiekele kukala kuje.]<verse eid="ACT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Vuno honi Paulu na Mbanambase vasalele mu Antioke, hamolika na vakuavo veka vavengi valongesele nakuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Muene.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu na Mbanambase valitepa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Ha ntsimbu imo Paulu uahandekele kuli Mbanambase nguendi, “Tuye tuhiluke linga tukameneke vaka kutsiliela mu vinganda vioshe muje tuambuluile lizi lia Muene, linga tukamone vati muje vali nakuyoya.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Kaha Mbanambase uatondele linga vaye hamo na Yiuano uje ivatumbuile Mako. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Vuno honi Paulu uasinganiekele nguendi keti cacili kuya nendi, muomu kakele hamo navo naku mamanusuilo a vipangi viavo, vuno honi uahilukile nakuvaseza mu Pamefiliya. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Hakele vimpata, kaha valitepele Mbanambase uambatele Mako nakuya ku Sepulasi mu vuato. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Vuno honi Paulu uahanguile Silasi nakuya nendi, vamutavesele kuli vaka kutsiliela kuhitila mu kavumbi ka Muene. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Omo vayile vahitile mu siliya namu Silisha mukukolesa vikungulukilo.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timateo aya hamo na Paulu na Silasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Kaha Paulu uahetele naua ku Ndemba na kuli Lisitala, kuje kuakele mukayesu umo lizina liendi Timateo. Vaina ya Timateo na vakevo vapuile vaka Kilistu vaje vapuile Kayunda, vuno honi vaishe vapuile Kangelengu. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Kaha voshe vaka kutsiliela vamu Lisitala na mu Ikoniyame vashangazalele cikuma Timateo. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Kaha Paulu uatondele kuya na Timateo, kaha uamulovuele. Ualingile vioshe evi muomu Vayunda voshe vaje vakele mu mitambela ije vazivukile ngeci ishe ya Timateo uapuile Kangelengu. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Omo vakele nakuhita mu vinganda, vahanene vaka kutsiliela mashiko aje avahanguile tunganda na vakuluntu mu Yelusalema, kaha vavalekele linga vononoke aje mashiko. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Vikungulukilo viakele na nzili mukutsiliela kaha valivuezelele ha litangua na litangua.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cimona ca Paulu mu Masendoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Kaha Paulu na vakuavo vahitile mu cihela ca Filingiya na mu Ngalatiya muomu Cimbembesi Uakulela uavavindikile kuambulula muzimbu mu nganda ya Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Kaha omo vahetele ku nginga ya Misiya vesekele kuya mu cifuti ca Mbitaniya, vuno honi Cimbembesi ua Yesu kavatavesele. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Nankuma vahitile mukati ka Misiya nakuya ku Tolouase. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Kaha ku vutsiki vuje vene Paulu uakele na cimona muje uamuene yala umo ua ku Masendoniya nemana nakumulomba nguendi, “Ija kuno ku Masendoniya uakutukuase.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Kaha omo Paulu uamuene eci cimona, hajevene tuakatukile nakuya ku Masendoniya, muomu tuasinganiekele nguetu Njambi natusana mukuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ku vantu kuje.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenguluka ca Lindiya mu Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Omo tuahumine ku Tolouase tuajavukile mu vuato nakuya ku Samotalase, kaha lia mukuavo tuayile mu Neyapolise. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Kaha kuhuma kuje tuahitile ku Filipi, nganda yamutambela uakulivanga mu cifuti ca Masendoniya, ikeyo naua yapuile nganda ya Loma kaha tuakele muje mu nganda matangua amengi. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Kaha lia Sapalalo tuakatukile mu nganda tuayile kungenge ya ndonga kuje tuayonguele nguetu kuli mutambela uakukungulukila mukulombela. Kaha tuatumamene nakusikama na vampuevo vaje vakungulukilile kuje. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Kaha umo uavo uatuvuile uapuile Lindiya uahumine ku Tiyatila uapuile mukakulandesa vintanga viacili viakuvenguluka naua uapuile mpuevo uakulemesa Njambi, kaha Muene uashokoluele mutima uendi mukuvuilila vije viakele nakuhandeka Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Omo vamumbuitikile ikeye na vantu vamu njivo yendi, kaha uatulaniene nguendi, “Ijeni mukakale mu njivo yange nga muasinganieka ngueni njinapu muka kutsiliela muli Muene.” Nankuma uatusindiyile linga tuye.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mu kamenga ku Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Ha litangua limo omo tuakele nakuya ku cihela cakulombelela, tualiuanene na ngamba ua mpuevo uje uakele na cimbembesi ca cipi cije cakele nakumupangesa mukumona viuma via kulutue. Kaha uapitisile cikuma muene uendi mukuhandeka viuma viacili vije vikalingiua kulutue. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Ou mpuevo uakavele Paulu hamo netu kaha uatambekele nguendi, “Ava vamala vanapu vangamba va Njambi Uahelu lia Vioshe! Vali nakuambulula kuli yeni ngila ya kuovoka!” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Nankuma ualingile eci matangua amengi, vuno honi Paulu uapihililile, kaha uatengulukile nakuhandeka kuli uje cimbembesi ca cipi nguendi, “Mu lizina lia Yesu Kilistu njikushika nguange huma muli ikeye!” Kaha hajevene cimbembesi ca cipi cahumine muli uje mpuevo. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Omo liavenia uje ngamba uevuile nguendi uje mpuevo ngila ya kupangelamo vimbongo inahu, vakuatele Paulu na Silasi nakuvakokangeya nakuvatuala hambanza kuli vakakusuana ku cihela cakulandesela. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Kaha vavatualele ku mesho a vakuluntu Valoma nakuhandeka nguavo, “Ava vamala vanapu Vayunda, kaha valinakuneha vukalu mu nganda yetu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Vali nakulongesa futisi ije iluisa Lishiko lietu, yetu tu Valoma, kaha kutuasa kutava futisi yavo cipue kuyikava!” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Kaha civunga coshe calitavasanene kuluisa Paulu na Silasi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Ambahoni honi vaje vakuluntu vatavozuele vuzalo via Paulu na Silasi. Nakushika ngeci vavapupe. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Omo vavapupile cikuma, vavahakele mu kamenga, kaha vashikile cikuma muka kuniunga kamenga ngeci apate cikuma ku vikolo. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Omo uje muka kuniunga kamenga uatambuile lishiko eli, kaha uavahakele mukati ka mulili ua kamenga nakuhaka mikono yavo mu vikuali.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Vuno honi mukati ka vutsiki Paulu na Silasi vakale nakulombela nakuimba miaso ya Njambi, kaha vaje vinzinda vakele mu kamenga vavovuililile. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Hajevene kuakele mandunduma akama cikuma kaha luvula lua kamenga luajajele cikuma. Hajevene vikolo via kamenga viashokolokele, kaha malienge ahumine ku vinzinda voshe. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Omo uje muka kuniunga kamenga uahindukile, kaha omo uamuene vikolo via shokoloka, uasinganiekele nguendi, vinzinda voshe vanateue, uashomuene mukuale uendi linga alitsihe. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Vuno honi Paulu uatambakanene cikuma na lizi liakama nguendi, “Keti ulitsihe! Muomu tuva voshe mutuli muno!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Uje muka kuniunga kamenga uasanene ngeci vamuneheleko ndeya, kaha uashatukililemo, kaha uatsikamene ku mikono ya Paulu na Silasi oku ali nakujaja. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Ambahoni uavatuhuile hambanza nakuvehula nguendi, “Muene, nkuma vika njapande kulinga ngeci njovoke?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Kaha vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Tsiliela kuli Muene Yesu, kaha ukovoka, yove na ntanga yove yoshe.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Ambahoni vambuluile lizi lia Muene kuli ikeye na kuli voshe vaje vakele mu njivo yendi. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Kaha ha ntsimbu ijevene ya vutsiki uje muka kuniunga kamenga uayile hamo navo, uakushile ha vimbandu viavo, kaha hajevene ikeye na ntanga yendi voshe vavambuitikile. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Ambahoni uatualele Paulu na Silasi ku njivo yendi, kaha uakavahanene viakulia. Ikeye na ntanga yendi vavuahelele cikuma muomu vatsilielele muli Njambi.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Liamukuavo cimene mene vakuluntu Valoma vashikile vantuama va masualale nguavo, “Eceleni ava vamala vaye.”<verse eid="ACT 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Kaha uje muka kuniunga kamenga ualekele Paulu nguendi, “Vakuluntu Valoma vanashiki lizi kuli yove na kuli Silasi nguavo tumiecele. Muasa kuya, kaha yeni mu ciyulo.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Vuno honi Paulu uahandekele kuli vaje vakuluntu va masualale va kamenga nguendi, “Kuvatuuanene na mulonga, vuno honi vanatupupilile ha mesho a vantu kuakuhona kutusompesa, cipuevene yetu tuapua vandambo va cifuti ca Loma! Kaha vanatuhakele mu kamenga. Nkuma vatonda kutuecela mu vushueke ndi? Houe! Vakuluntu Valoma vakevo vanapande kuija kuno linga vakutuecele vakevo vavenia linga tuye.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Kaha vantuama va masualale vambuluile mezi aua kuli vakuluntu Valoma, kaha omo vovuile ngeci Paulu na Silasi vapuile vandambo va cifuti ca Loma, kaha vovuile liova. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Kaha vayile kuli vakevo nakulomba cikonekelo, ambahoni vavahumisile mu kamenga, kaha vavalombele linga vahume mu nganda ije. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Omo Paulu na Silasi vahumine mu kamenga, vayile ku njivo ya Lindiya. Kuje vakaliuanene na vaka kutsiliela, kaha vahandekele kuli vakevo mezi akuvasimpisa, kaha vayile.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Paulu na Silasi mu Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Omo Paulu na Silasi vayile vahitile mu Afipolise na mu Apoloniya, kaha vezile ku Tesalonika, kuje kuakele njivo ya malombelo. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Kaha ngue kuya ku cilika cendi Paulu, uayile mu njivo ya malombelo ha matangua atatu a Sapalalo uakele nakuhandeka na vantu via mu mikanda, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />nakuvalumbunuina visoneka, nakuvamuesa vukaleho vua kuhuma mu visoneka ngeci Kilistu napande kuyanda nakusanguka ku vatsi. Kaha Paulu uahandekele nguendi, “Ou Yesu injihandeka kuli yeni ikeye vene Kilistu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Kaha vamo hakati kavo vatsilielele, valipandakanene na Paulu na Silasi hamo na vampuevo vaje vapuile vantuama na civunga cakama ca Vangelengu vaje vakakulemesa Njambi.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Vuno honi Vayunda vakele na cipululu, kaha vakunguluile vamo viendangane va mihuza mu vitapalo, kaha vapangele civunga. Vanehele citanga cakama muje mu nganda yoshe, kaha valuisile njivo ya Njasone mukueseka kuuana Paulu na Silasi linga vavatuale ku civunga ca vantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Vuno honi omo kuvavauanene, vakokangeyele Njasone na vamo vaka kutsiliela nakuvatuala ku vakuluntu va nganda kaha vatambakanene nguavo, “Ava vamala vananeha vukalu mu cifuti coshe kaha vaneja kuno, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />kaha Njasone uavatambuile mu njivo yendi. Voshe valinakupokola mashiko a Sezale nakuhandeka nguavo kuli muene ueka naua lizina liendi Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Kaha ha mezi aua vanehele citanga cakama ku civunga na ku vakuluntu va nganda. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Kaha vakuluntu va nganda vafuetesele Njasone na vakuavo vimbongo vije viatondekele linga vavecele vaye.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu na Silasi mu Mbeleya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Hajevene omo vutsiki vuezile vaka kutsiliela vatumine Paulu na Silasi ku Mbeleya. Omo vahetele kuje vayile mu njivo ya malombelo ya Vayunda. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Vayunda vakuje vapuile va ceke kupulakana vaku Tesalonika. Vakele nakuivuilila ku lizi na mitima yakuzituka kaha ha litangua na litangua vakele nakutanda mu visoneka linga vamone vije viahandekele Paulu indi via vusunga. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Vuingi vua Vayunda nankuma vatsilielele, kaha na vampuevo vamo vavengi va vakuluntu va Vangelengu na vamala vamo vavengi va Vangelengu vatsilielele navo. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Vuno honi omo Vayunda vaku Tesalonika vazivukile nguavo Paulu nambulula lizi lia Njambi mu Mbeleya vayile kuje naku shongangeya civunga. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Kaha hajevene vaka kutsiliela vatumine Paulu ku cikuma ca cisali, vuno honi Silasi na Timateo vasalele mu Mbeleya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Kaha vamala vasindikiyile Paulu vayile nendi kuvanga naku Atena kaha vahilukilile ku Mbeleya, Paulu uavashikile nguendi Silasi na Timateo vanapande kumukavangeya vuasi vuasi.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu mu Atena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Omo tele Paulu uakele nakuvandamena Silasi na Timateo mu Atena, uanienguele cikuma omo uamuene muje mu nganda muashulile tuponia tuatuingi cikuma. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Kaha muje mu njivo ya malombelo uahandekele na Vayunda na vaje keti Vayunda vaje vaka kulemesa Njambi, kaha ha litangua na litangua uakele nakuhandeka na vaje vakele nakuliuana navo ku cihela cakulandesela. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Vamo vaka kulilongesa vaje vakele nakukavangeya vilongesa via Epikuliu na vilongesa via Sitoike valingile vimpata nendi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Kaha vamo vamuihuile nguavo, “Nkuma vika atonda kuhandeka ou cilema uakulihalesa?” Veka vahandekele nguavo, “Kumoneka ngue ali nakuhandeka vanjambi veka naua.” Vahandekele evi omo Paulu uakele nakuambulula via Yesu na cisangukilo. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Vamuambatele nakumutuala ku mpunga ya nganda ya Alapangase nakuhandeka nguavo, “Tutonda kuzivuka eci cuma caciha ci ulinakulongesa. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Omo vimo viuma vituli nakuivua uhandeka vinapu viaviha kuli yetu, kaha tutonda kuzivuka muvialumbunukilamo.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Omo vaka Atena voshe na vangenzi vakele muje vatondele kupihisa ntsimbu yavo yoshe mukuhandeka na kuivua viuma viaviha)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Ambohoni Paulu uemanene ha lutue lua mpunga ya Alepangase nakuhandeka nguendi, “Yeni vantu vamu Atena, njamono nguange mu vilinga vieni vioshe munapu mu vaka kulemesa. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Muomu njakele nakuenda mu nganda yeni nakutala muacili mutambela uje muka lemesela, njauanene ha mutula uasonekele nguavo, ‘Kuli Njambi uje kutuzivuka.’ Cije mukalemesa cipue ku mucizivuka cikeco cije njilinakuambulula kuli yeni lelo. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Njambi uje uatangele cifuti na vioshe vije vilimo, uapua Muene ua melu na mavu, kaha kekuyoya mu njivo yakutunga ku mavoko a vantu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Cipue kekutonda linga tumupangele cipue cuma cimo, muomu ikeye akahana muono na mpunzi ije ituhuima na viuma vioshe ku vantu voshe. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kaha uatangele miyati yoshe kuhuma kuli yala umo ngeci vakale ha mavu oshe. Ikeye vavenia uavuahesele laja vintsimbu na vinginga na vihela kuje vaka yoyela. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Ualingile eci linga vamutonde, kaha omo vakamutonda hamo vaka muuana. Vuno honi cipue ngoco Njambi kakele kulako netu houe, <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />ngue umo uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Muli ikeye mukemo mutuayoyela, mukemuo mutuendela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 17:28">mukemuo mutuli.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Ngue muje muihandeka miaso yeni imo nguayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Netu naua tunapu tuvana vendi.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Kaha hakupua tuvana vendi, kutuapandele kusinganieka nguetu Njambi uapua ngue cifua ca Ngolinde cipue ca Siliva indi cipue livue lia kushonga na vutongue na mana a muntu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Laja Njambi uakele nakutalelela vantu omo kuvamuzivukele, kaha hano honi alinakushika vantu voshe kuoshe linga vatenguluke ku vipi viavo. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Muomu nalivuahesela laja litangua lije akasompa cifuti lioshe kuakuhona kahangu kuhitila muli yala uje yanahangula. Kaha ha cuma eci nahana vukaleho ku muntu uoshe hakusangula uje yala ku vatsi!<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Honi omo vovuile Paulu ahandeka kusanguka ku vatsi, vamo vamushendumuine vuno honi vamo vahandekele nguavo, “Tutonda linga tuvue viuma evi naua kuli yove.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Kaha Paulu uasezele cije cikungulukilo. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Vuno honi vamo vamala valipandakanene nendi nakupua vaka kutsiliela, hakati kavo umo uapuile Ndiyonisiyase, uapuile umo ua mpunga ya Elepase, na mpuevo umo lizina liendi Ndamalise, navakuavo veka naua.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Paulu mu Kolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Hanima ya viuma evi, Paulu uahumine ku Atena nakuya ku Kolinte. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Kaha kuje ualiuanene na Kayunda ua lizina lia Akuila, uje uasemukilile ku Pontase, uje uahuminine ku Itali na mpueyendi Pilisila, muomu Sezale Kalaundiase uashikile linga Vayunda voshe vahume mu Loma. Kaha Paulu uayile nakuvamona, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />kaha uatumamene nakupanga hamo navo, muomu uakele nakutunga vimbalaka, ngue muvakele nakulinga vakevo. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Paulu uakele nakuhandeka mu njivo ya malombelo ha litangua lia Sapalalo lioshe, mukueseka kukoka Vayunda na Vangelengu ngeci vatsiliele.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Omo Silasi na Timateo vahetele kuhuma ku Masendoniya, Paulu ha ntsimbu yendi yoshe ualihanene kuambulula muzimbu nakuhana vukaleho kuli Vayunda ngeci Yesu ikeye Kilistu. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Omo vamuluisile nakuhandeka viuma via vipi kuli ikeye, kaha uatotomuene likungu ku vintanga viendi nakuhandeka nguendi, “Nga munazimbala, unapu mulonga ueni vavenia! Yange kunjesi namulonga naumo uahi. Kuhuma lelo nakuya kulutue njiya kuli vaje keti Vayunda.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Nankuma Paulu uahumine mu njivo ya malombelo ya Vayunda nakuya ku njivo ya yala umo lizina liendi, Tito Yusitase muka kulemesa Njambi, njivo yendi yalihatela na cikolo ca njivo ya malombelo. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kilisipase uje uapuile ntuama ua mu njivo ya malombelo uje uatsilielele muli muene hamo lika na ntanga yendi yoshe, na vantu vavengi vamu Kolinte vovuile lizi na kutsiliela kaha vavambuitikile.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Vutsiki vumo Paulu uamuene cimona cije Muene uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Keti uvue liova, vuno honi tualelelaho kuhandeka kaha keti ulikele, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />muomu yange njili hamo nove. Kaha naumo uahi asa kukuvulumuna, muomu njili na vantu vavengi mu nganda eyi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Paulu uakele kuje muaka umo na vingonde vitanu na imo, mukulongesa vantu lizi lia Njambi.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Vuno honi omo Ngaliyo uapuile nguvulu ua Loma mu nganda ya Akaya, kaha Vayunda valikunguluile hamo vakuatele Paulu nakumutuala hambanza lia nzango ya kusompela. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Vahandekele nguavo, “Ou yala alinakusindiya vantu kulemesa Njambi mu ngila ya kuluisa Lishiko!”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Tele Paulu uatondele kuhandeka kaha Ngaliyo uahandekele kuli Vayunda nguendi, “Nga eci cimpande capuile ca mulonga uakuvulumuna cipue via vupi vumo vuanalingi, ngue njinovuilila yeni Vayunda. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Vuno honi muomu cinapu cimpande ca kuliviana ha mezi na mazina na Lishiko lieni vavenia, munapande kuvimanusula yeni vavenia. Yange kunjapandele kupua lihako ua viuma evi!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Kaha uavashekele mu nzango ya kusompela. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Voshe vakokangeyele Sosetene, uje uapuile ntuama ua njivo ya malombelo, vamupupilile ha mesho a nzango yakusompela. Vuno honi Ngaliyo kahakeleleko mana ku cuma cije.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu ahiluka ku Antioke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Hanima ya viuma evi Paulu uakele mu Kolinte hamo na vaka kutsiliela ha matangua amengi, kaha honi uavasezele uayile mu vuato ku Siliya hamo na Pilisila na Akuila. Tele kanda ahume ku Senkilise Paulu uatehuile ku mutue uendi muomu ya cisingo cije calisingile. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Omo uahetele mu Efeso, kuje Paulu uasezele Pilisila na Akuila, uakovelele mu njivo ya malombelo nakuhandeka na Vayunda. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Omo vantu vamulombele linga akale navo ntsimbu yalaha, vuno kavatavele. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Vuno honi omo uavasezele uavalekele nguendi, “Nga eci cinapu cizango ca Njambi, kaha njikahiluka naua kuli yeni.” Kaha uakovelele mu vuato nakuhuma ku Efeso.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Omo uahetele ku Sesaliya, uayile ku Yelusalema mukukameneka cikungulukilo, ambahoni uayile ku Antioke. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Munima yakukala navo ntsimbu imo, uahumineko uayile ku cihela ca Ngalatiya na mu Filingiya nakukakolesa vandongisi voshe.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolo mu Efeso na mu Kolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Ha ntsimbu ije Kayunda umo ua lizina lia Apolo uje uasemukilile mu Alekizandiliya uezile ku Efeso. Uapuile muntu uakuhandeka muacili, kaha uakele na mana akulumbununa visoneka. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Vamunanguile laja mu Ngila ya Muene, kaha uakele na ntuima yakuambulula nakulongesa muacili viuma via hali Yesu. Cipuevene ikeye uazivukile lika viakumbuitika ca Yiuano. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Uaputukile kuhandeka nakusimpa mu njivo ya malombelo. Vuno honi omo Pilisila na Akuila vamuvuile, vamutualele ku njivo nakumunangula muacili cikuma Ngila ya Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Omo Apolo uatondele kuya ku Akaya, kaha vaka kutsiliela va mu Efeso vamukuasele mukusonekela mukanda ku vandongisi va mu Akaya nakuvalomba ngeci vamutambule muacili. Omo uahetele kuje, uapuile mukakukuasa cikuma kuli vaje vapuile vaka kutsiliela ngue ku kavumbi ka Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Muomu ikeye na nzili yendi uavianene cikuma Vayunda muvihandeka viavo citona mesho mukumuesa vukaleho vua mu visoneka ngeci Yesu ikeye Kilistu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paulu mu Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Tele omo Apolo uakele mu Kolinte, Paulu uahitile ku vihela via minkinda via mu nganda kaha uasikumukilile ku Efeso. Kuje uakauanene vandongisi vamo, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Nkuma muatambuileho Cimbembesi Uakulela omo muapuile vaka kutsiliela ndi?” Vamukumbuluile nguavo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">“Houe, kanda tuivueho nguavo kuakala Cimbembesi Uakulela.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Nkuma cimbuitiko muka vamimbuitikile naco?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Vamukumbuluile nguavo, “Cimbuitiko ca muka kumbuitika Yiuano.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Kaha Paulu uahandekele nguendi, “Yiuano uambuitikile mu cimbuitikilo cakutenguluka ku vupi, kulekesa vantu linga vatsiliele kuli uje eja munima yendi, uje ikeye, Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Omo vovuile eci, kaha vavambuitikile mu lizina lia Muene Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Omo Paulu uavasalekele mavoko endi, Cimbembesi Uakulela uezile hali vakevo kaha vaputukile kuhandeka mu vindaka vieka kaha naua vaputukile kuambulula vunanguizi. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Voshe vapuile ngue likumi na vavali.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Paulu uakovelele mu njivo ya malombelo kaha ha vingonde vitatu uahandekele nakusimpa, nakulambelela cikuma vantu via Vumuene vua Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Vuno honi vamo vakukola mitima vavianene kutsiliela nakuhandeka viavipi ha ngila ya Njambi ku mesho ya civunga ca vantu, kaha uavasezele, ha kuya na vandongisi uakele nakuhandeka navo mu njivo ya kuli longesela mu Tilanase. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Eci catualeleho ha miaka ivali, linga vantu voshe vamu nganda ya Asiya, na Vayunda na Vangelengu vovue lizi lia Muene.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vana va vamala va Sikeva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Njambi ualingile vikomoueso viavingi kuhitila muli Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Cipue vitambala na vuzalo vije viakele nakulikuasesa vavihanene kuli vaka kuvavala, kaha na mishongo yoshe yavahumine, kaha na vimbembesi viavipi viahumine muli vakevo. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Ambahoni vamo Vayunda vaje vakele nakuendangana nakueseka kuhumisa vimbembesi via vipi mukulikuasesa lizina lia Muene Yesu kuhumisa vimbembesi viavipi. Kaha vakele nakuhandeka kuli vaje vakele navio nguavo, “Njimishika mu lizina lia Yesu uje yali nakuambulula Paulu humamo.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Vaje vana vatanu na vavali va vamala va Kayunda uje uapuile Mukuluntu ua Kasasendote ivatumbuile nguavo Sikeva, vakevo vakele nakulinga evi.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Vuno honi cimbembesi cacipi cahandekele kuli vakevo nguaco, “Yesu njamuzivuka, na Paulu naua njamuivuaho viendi, vuno honi nkuma, yeni veya?”<verse eid="ACT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Kaha uje yala uakele na cimbembesi cacipi uavaluisile, navukalu, nakuvahiana voshe kaha vahumine mu njivo cakuhona vuzalo na vimbandu. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Omo eci vacizivukile kuli Vayunda na Vangelengu na vantu voshe vaje vakele mu Efeso, kaha muntu uoshe uakele na liova, kaha lizina lia Muene Yesu valilemesele. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Kaha naua vuingi vuavaje vapuile vaka kutsiliela valitavelele vipi viavo na kuhandeka vilinga viavo. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Vuingi vua vaje vakele nakulinga mantseno vambatele mavulu avo naku atsimika hakati ka civunga, kaha omo vapandakanene vimbongo via aje mavulu viapuile makulukazi a makumi atanu a vimbongo via muuaya uaya ua Siliva (50,000) <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Kaha mungila eyi vene lizi lia Muene liakolele cikuma nakushandokela kuoshe.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpindangano mu Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Hanima ya viuma evi kulingiua, Paulu uasinganiekele kuhita ku Masendoniya na ku Akaya nakutualelelaho kuya ku Yelusalema. Kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Hanima yakuya kuje, njinapande naua kuya ku Loma”. <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Kaha uatumine vakuasi vendi vavali, Timateo na Elasitase ku Masendoniya, muka ntsimbu lika ikeye uakele mu nganda ya Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Ha ntsimbu ije kuakele mpindangano yakama mu Efeso muomu ya Ngila ya Muene. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Yala umo ivatumbuile nguavo Ndemeteliase muka kufula viuma via siliva, ualingile cifua ca njivo ya siliva yakulifua ngue njivo ya Atemesi kamponia ua mpuevo, kaha evi vipangi viendi vianehele vimbongo viavingi kuli vaka kupanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Uakunguluile voshe hamolika vakuavo veka vaje vakele navipangi ngue viavo, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni vamala, muazivuka ngueni vufuko vuetu vukahumu ku vipangi evi. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Mu namono kaha munevu naua nguavo keti mu Efeso lika vuno honi na mu mutambela ua nganda ya Asiya, ou Paulu nakoko vantu vavengi nakuhandeka nguendi tumponia tuakupanga na mavoko kutuapuile vanjambi. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Kaha kuli vukalu keti lika kundando yetu vuno honi naua na ku njivo yakama ya kamponia ua mpuevo Atemise kuvaihana kalemesa, kaha uoshe muntu ua mu nganda Asiya na cifuti coshe uahi akamulemesa!”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Omo vovuile evi, vanienguele na kutambakana nguavo, “Uakama Atemise kamponia ua vaka Efeso!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Mu nganda muoshe muakele kalua, kaha vantu vashatukilile mu njivo yakuehela kaha vakuatele Ngayase na Alisitakase, vaku Masendoniya vavali vaje vakele nakusindikiya Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulu uazangele kuya hakati ka civunga, vuno honi vandongisi vamuvindikile, <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />navajevene vakuluntu va nganda ya Asiya, vaje vapuile vasepa vendi, vamutuminine mezi akumulekesa nguavo keti akovele mu njivo yakuehela. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Ha ntsimbu ijevene, vamo vakele na kutambakana cuma cimo, vamo cikuavo, kaha civunga cakele na kalua na vuingi vuavo kuvazivukile cije civalikunguluilile hamo. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Vamo vantu va ha civunga cije vasompesele Elekizanda, uje ivatualele Vayunda kulutue. Kaha Elekizanda uavaholuesele nakueseka kuliohiela hakati ka vantu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Vuno honi omo vazivukile nguavo ikeye Kayunda, mu vintsimbu vivali voshe vatambakanene mukulivuasana nguavo, “Uakama Atemise kamponia ua vaka Efeso!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Vuno honi omo muka kusoneka ua nganda uaholuesele civunga, uahandekele nguendi, “Vantu va mu Efeso, nkuma iya kazivuka nguendi nganda ya Efeso yapua njivo ya kutumbikila Atemisi uakama na kamponia uje uauile muilu? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Muomu viuma evi kuviasiua kuviviana munapande kuholoka kaha naua keti mulinge viuma muvuasi. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Munanehe vantu ava keti ngue vezi va mu njivo ya tumponia cipue ngue vanashaula kamponia ua mpuevo. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Nga Ndemeteliase na vaka kupanga vendi valina kuvangeyaho umo, vinzango viashokoloka mukuhana ciyulo, kaha tuli naua na vaka nzili yakama vaka kusompesa kaha veceleni vanehe vimpande viavo viakuliluisa vakevo vavenia. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Vuno honi nga kuli vimo vikuavo mutonda kuzivuka, munapande kuvihandekela mu nzango yakuliuanena. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Muomu hanima yevi vinalingiua lelo, tuli muvukalu vuakama vuakutuvangeya nguavo yetu tunanehe mpindangano. Kaha kukuesi kukonekela ha kalua aka koshe kanalingiua lelo, kutuasa kuhana vukaleho vuacili ha viuma evi.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Hanima yakuhandeka evi uasunuine civunga eci.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Paulu aya ku Masendoniya naku Akaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Hanima yakuhua mpindangano ije Paulu uasanene vandongisi, kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo mezi akuvasimpisa nakuvasalesa. Ambahoni uakatukile nakuya ku Masendoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Uahitile mu vihela vije nakukolesa cikuma vandongisi, uayile ku Akaya, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />kuje uakatumamene vingonde vitatu. Ha ntsimbu ije uakele nakulivuahesela linga aye ku Siliya omo uazivukile ngeci Vayunda vali na vutumbe vua kumuluisa, kaha uasinganiekele kuhiluka ku Masendoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Vamusindikiyile kuli Sopata muna Pihase uakuhuma ku Mbeleya, na Alisitikase na Sekundase uaku Matesalonika, na Ngayase na Timateo vaku ndemba, Taikikase na Tolofimase vaku nganda ya Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Vayile kulutue luetu na kutuvandamena mu Tolouase, <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />vuno honi tuajavukile mu vuato kuhuma ku Filipi hanima ya ciuano ca mbolo yakuhona cimbaluila, kaha munima ya matangua atanu tuakavauanene ku Tolouase, kuje kukeko tuakakele matangua atanu na avali.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu aya luakumanusuila ku Tolouase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Ku cinguezi cakuhua ca litangua lia Sapalalo, tualiuanene nakutavula mbolo, kaha Paulu uakele nakuhandeka navo, kaha uatualeleho kuhandeka cikuma noho mukati kavutsiki, muomu uatondele kuya lia mukuavo. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Muakele vindeya viavingi mu milili ua kuilu uje tuakele nakuliuanena. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Mukuenje ua lizina lia Yutikase, uje uatumamene ku njanena, uakosele tulo omo tele Paulu alinakuhandeka ntsimbu yalaha, kaha uauililile ha mavu kuhuma haje ha mulili uahelu lia njivo ya mu citatu. Kaha omo uamukuatele uauanene ngeci natsi. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Vuno honi Paulu uasikumukile ha mavu, nakukotama hali ikeye nakumuvumbatela. Kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Keti mulishoshomuene, muomu hanga acili nakuyoya!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Ambahoni Paulu ualondele ku mulili ua kuilu, kaha hanima yakupazula mbolo na kulia, uatualeleho kuhandeka navo mu ntsimbu yalaha noho cimene, kaha uayile. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Kaha vatualele uje mukuenje kuimbo liavo oku tele ali na kuyoya kaha eci cavasimpisile cikuma.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu ahuma ku Tolouase aya ku Miletase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Vuno honi yetu tualivangele kuya mu vuato nakukajavuka kuya ku Asose, kuje tuayile nakukambata Paulu linga akovele mu vuato. Uatushikile kulinga evi, muomu uayile kuje na ngila ya ntunda. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Omo uatuuanene ku Asose, tuamukovelesele mu vuato kaha tuahetele ku Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Kaha omo tuajavukile mu vuato kuhuma kuje, liamukuavo tuahetele kuje ku cihela ca kulitala na Ciyosi, kaha liamukuavo tuayile ku Samose kaha naua hanima ya litangua eli tuayile ku Miletu. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Nankuma, Paulu uasinganiekele kuhona kuhita ku Efeso, linga keti akale ntsimbu yalaha mu Asiya, muomu uatondele kuheta ku Yelusalema, ngue casiua, ha litangua lia Pentekosita mu nganda ya Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mezi a Paulu akulisalesa na vakuluntu mu Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Omo uakele ku Miletu kaha uatumine mezi ku Efeso ku vakuluntu va cikungulukilo linga valiuane nendi. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Kaha omo vezile kuli ikeye, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Yeni vavenia muazivuka omo njayoyele hakati keni ha ntsimbu yoshe kuputuka ha litangua liakulivanga lije linjahetele mu nganda ya Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />mukupangela Muene nakulihana na masozi na vieseko vianjiuanene muomu yakunjiyandesa kuli Vayunda. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Nacimo cahi cije cacili njahonouele kuhandeka kuli yeni, kaha naua nakumilongesela hakati ka vantu, kaha nakumilongesela ku njivo na njivo. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Nakuhana vukaleho kuli Vayunda na Vangelengu ha kutengulukila kuli Njambi na lutsilielo kuli Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Kaha taleni njilinakuya ku Yelusalema ngue muje muatondelamo Cimbembesi Uakulela, kuakuhona kuzivuka vika vije vikalingiua kuli yange. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Njazivukile lika nguange mu nganda muoshe Cimbembesi Uakulela anjinangula nguendi, kamenga na vukalu vinanjivandamena. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Vuno honi njasinganieka nguange muono uange kuuesi na seho kuli yange, njatondo lika kumanesa vipangi vianjihanene Muene Yesu kuvilinga, vije vikevio kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua kavumbi ka Njambi.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Kaha honi njazivuka nguange naumo uahi hakati keni injinambuluila Vumuene vua Njambi, akamonaho cihanga cange, lueka naua. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Nankuma njimilekesa ha litangua lia lelo nguange kunjesi na mulonga ua maninga hali umo ueni nga azimbala. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Muomu kunjahonouele kumileka vioshe via cizango ca Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Liniungeni kaha naua niungeni vutanga vua vampanga vuje Cimbembesi Uakulela namihana kutala, kuniunga cikungulukilo ca Njambi cije calandele na maninga a munendi. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Njazivuka nguange nga njinai, tungunga vaje vakuteuesa vakeja hakati keni na kupihisa vutanga vua vampanga. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Vamo vaku civunga ceni vakeja nakuhandeka makuli linga vatangule vandongisi ngeci vavakave. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Nankuma zangameni, vulukeni ngueni ha miaka itatu vutsiki na mutania kunjahonouele kunangula uoshe na masozi.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Kaha honi njimikundika kuli Njambi linga aminiunge naku muzimbu ua Kavumbi kendi, uje uasa kumitungisa na kumihana vikuisulo vije viali navio Njambi ha vantu vendi voshe. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Ku njatondele siliva cipue ngolinde cipue vuzalo vua muntu. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Muazivuka yeni vavenia ngueni njapangele na mavoko ange vavenia hakulikuasa yange vavenia na vakuasi vange. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Ha vioshe evi njamihana cimueso ngeci ha vipangi evi tuapande kukuasa vaka kuzeya, kuvuluka mezi a Muene Yesu, muomu ikeye vavenia uahandekele nguendi, ‘Cinapu cakukuisula cikuma kuhana kupulakana kutambula.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Omo uamanuisile kuhandeka, uatsikamene ha mavu navo voshe na kulombela. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Valilile cikuma hakati kavo voshe, kaha vamuvumbatelele na kumutsemba. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Vakele na vusiua muomu vovuile ahandekele nguendi ku vakamumonoho ceka naua. Kaha vamusindikiyile ku vuato.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Paulu aya ku Yelusalema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Hanima yakulisalesa navo kaha tuajavukilile musinia, kaha tuahetele ku Kose, lia mukuavo tuahetele ku Londese, kaha kuhuma kuje tuahetele ku Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Omo tuauanene vuato vuakuya ku Fonisiya, tuakovelele mu vuato kaha tuayile. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Omo tuahetele tuamuene Sepulasi, kaha tuajavukilile ku mbuela yaku Siliya kaha tuahetele ku Tile, muomu vuato vuapandele kuhumisa vitenga kuje. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Tuakauanene vandongisi kaha tuakakele navo matangua atanu na avali. Kuhitila mu Cimbembesi valekele Paulu nguavo keti aye ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Omo matangua etu ahuile kuje, tuatualeleleho na vungenzi vuetu, kaha voshe va mala na va mpuevo vavo na vanike, vatusindikiyile hakuhuma mu nganda. Kuje tuakatsikamene ha mavu ku cikuma ca cisali kaha tualombelele. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ambahoni tualisalesele umo namukuavo. Kaha tuayile nakukovela mu vuato, kaha vakevo vahilukile ku membo avo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Tuatualeleho vungenzi vuetu kuhuma ku Tile, kaha tuahetele ku Putolemaise kuje tuamenekele vaka kutsiliela kaha tuatumamene navo litangua limo. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Omo kuacele tuayile kaha tuahetele ku Sesaliya, tuakovelele mu njivo ya Filipu uje muka kutuala lizi lia Njambi ku vantu, umo uavaje vatanu na vavali, vaje vavahanguile kupua vakuasi mu Yelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Filipu uakele na vana vendi vauana va vampuevo vakuhona kushomboka vaje vakele nakuambulula vunanguizi. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Tuatumamene kuje ha matangua amo, kananguizi ivatumbuile nguavo Angambase uezile kuhuma ku Yundeya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Uezile kuli yetu kaha uambatele muiva ua Paulu, ualikutile ku viliato naku mavoko endi na muiva uje, nakuhandeka nguendi, “Cimbembesi Uakulela nahandeka nguendi, omu mukemo vene muje Vayunda vamu Yelusalema vakakuta vavenia muiva ou nakumuhana kuli vaje keti Vayunda.”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Omo tuevuile eci, yetu na vakuetu vakele muje tualambelele Paulu linga keti aye ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Ambahoni Paulu uakumbuluile nguendi, “Nkuma vika muli nakulilila ngacije, muli nakupokola mutima uange? Njalivuahesela laja keti lika kunjikuta vuno honi cipue kukatsila mu Yelusalema muomu ha lizina lia Muene Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Muomu kutuasele kumusindiya, tuaholokele kuluu kaha tuahandekele nguetu, “Cizango ca Muene cilingiue.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Hanima ya matangua akukala kuje kaha tualivuaheselele kuya ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Vamo va vandongisi vaje vahumine ku Sesaliya na vakevo naua vezile netu kaha vatutualele ku njivo ya Manasone ua ku Sepulasi, uje uapuile ndongisi uakulivanga.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu ameneka Yakomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Omo tuahetele ku Yelusalema, kaha vamuanetu vaka kutsiliela vatutambuile muacili. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Omo kuacele Paulu uayile netu hamo nakukamona Yakomba, na vakuluntu va cikungulukilo navakevo kuvakele. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Hanima yakuvameneka, Paulu ualumbuniune cimo na cimo ha viuma vije Njambi ualingile kuli vaje keti Vayunda kuhitila mu cipangi cendi. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Omo vacivuile, vashangazalele Njambi. Ambahoni vahandekele kuli vakevo nguavo, “Tala, muanetu Paulu, unamono vati muje makulukazi aje a Vayunda muvana tengulukilamo kupua vaka kutsiliela, na muje vati muvana lihanenamo vakevo vavenia voshe ku Lishiko lia Mosesa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Vanavalekesa viove nguavo ulinakulongesa voshe Vayunda vaje vatunga hakati kavaje keti Vayunda linga keti vakave Lishiko lia Mosesa, kaha naua nguove keti valovole vana vavo cipue keti vaniunge futisi ya Vayunda. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Cilivene omo vakevua nguavo uneja, nkuma vikahoni vikalingiua? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Evi vikevio vitutonda yove linga uvilinge. Kuli vamala vauana kuno vaje vanalisingi. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Ya hamo nava vamala vauana ulipandakane navo mu cilika ca kulilelesa, kaha fueta ndando yavo, linga vakatehule ku mitue yavo. Mu ngila eyi vene muntu uoshe akazivuka ngeci vioshe vijevene vanakala nakuhandeka hali yove keti via vusunga, vuno honi yove vavenia uli nakuononoka Lishiko lia Mosesa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Vuno honi hali ava keti Vayunda vaje vanapu vaka kutsiliela, tunatumu mukanda ua kusompa cetu nguetu vahume ku viakulia vije vanakombelela ku tumponia naku maninga naku tusitu vakutikinia nakulihumisa vakevo vavenia ku vupangala.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Ambahoni liamukuavo Paulu uayile navaje vamala hanima yakulilelesa, uakovelele mu Njivo ya Njambi navo, nakuvalekesa matangua a kulilelesa muje muakahuila, omo vaka kombelela nkombelo hali umo na umo uavo.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu vamukuta mu Njivo ya Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Vuno honi omo matangua atanu na avali tele atonda kuhua, Vayunda vaje vahumine ku nganda ya Asiya, vaje vamuene Paulu mu Njivo ya Njambi. Vashongangeyele civunga coshe linga vakuate Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Vatambekele nguavo, “Vamala vaku Isaleli, tukuaseni! Ou ikeye yala uje ali nakulongesa vantu voshe kuoshe linga valuise vantu Vaisaleli, na Lishiko lia Mosesa, na ino Njivo ya Njambi. Kaha honi nanehe naua na Vangelengu mu Njivo ya Njambi linga vajualese eci cihela cakulela.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Vahandekele evi muomu vamuene Tolofimase uaku Efeso hamolika na Paulu mu nganda, kaha vasinganiekele nguavo hamo Paulu uamutualele mu Njivo ya Njambi.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Kaha citanga eci cashandokelele mu nganda yoshe, kaha vantu voshe vashatukile hamo. Vakuatele Paulu nakumuhumisa mu Njivo ya Njambi, kaha hajevene vashokele vikolo. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Cije civunga catondele kutsiha Paulu, kaha lizi lia ile kuli ntuama ua masualale ua Loma ngualio Yelusalema yoshe ili mumpindangano. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Hajevene uje ntuama ua masualale uambatele masualale na vantuama va masualale kaha vashatukilile ku civunga. Omo vamuene uje ntuama na masualale, kaha vecelele kupupa Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Kaha ntuama ua masualale uezile kuli Paulu, uamukutile, kaha uavashikile nguendi vamukute na malienge avali. Ambahoni uavehuile nguendi, “Nkuma iya honi ou yala, kaha naua nalingi vika?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Vamo mu civunga vatambekele vimo, vakuavo naua vieka. Kuakele mpindangano yakama kaha uje ntuama ua masualale kovuisisile muacili vika vije vialingiuile, nankuma uavashikile ngeci vatuale Paulu ku vinjivo kuje kuvakakala masualale. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Omo Paulu uahetele ha vindendelo, kaha civunga ca tenukile cikuma nankuma valingile uakukakula ku masualale. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Civunga cije cavakavele catualeleho kutambeka nguaco, “Mutsiheni!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu aliamena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Omo masualale vatondele kutuala Paulu mu vinjivo muje muakala masualale. Kaha Paulu uahandekele kuli uje ntuama ua masualale nguendi, “Nkuma njasakuhandekako cuma cimo kuli yove ndi?” Uje ntuama ua masualale uakumbuilile nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">“Nkuma uasa kuhandeka Cingelengu ndi?” <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Nkuma keti yove Kaingito uje ha ntsimbu yakunima uatengulukilile vumuene nakutuamenena vamala vanzita vakupua makulukazi auana (4,000) mu ndinda ndi?<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulu uakumbuluile nguendi, “Yange nji Kayunda, njasemukilile ku Tasisi mu Silisha, mundambo ua nganda yakasingimiko. Njitavese linga njihandeke ku vantu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Kaha uje ntuama ua masualale uamuhanene ntsimbu yakuhandeka, kaha Paulu uemanene ha vindendelo nakuolola livoko liendi linga vantu vaholoke. Omo vantu vaholokele, Paulu uahandekele kulivakevo mu Cihevelu.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Vamuanetu na vatatetu Vayunda, njivuilileni omo njili nakuliohiela hakati keni.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Omo vamuvuile ali nakuhandeka kuli vakevo mu Cihevelu, kaha vaholokele kuluu. Kaha uahandekele nguendi,<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Yange Kayunda, njasemukilile ku Tasisi mu Silisha, vuno honi njakolela mu nganda ino vene ya Yelusalema, kaha Ngamaliele ikeye uapuile mulongisi uange, nakulilongesa muacili via Lishiko lia vakukuluila vetu, na kulikolesa cikuma kuli Njambi, ngue omo mumunapu muva voshe vaje valikuno lelo. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Njapakesele noho nja tsihile vantu vaje vakavele Ngila ya Muene eyi. Njakutile vamala na vampuevo nakuvatuala mu kamenga. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Kasesondote uakama na mpunga yoshe vasa kuhana vukaleho hali yange. Kulivakevo njatambuile mikanda ya kuhuminina kuli vakuetu Vayunda va ku Ndamasika, kaha njaileko linga njikakuate vaje vakele kuje nakuvahiluisa mu Yelusalema linga vavazangamese.”<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu ahandeka muje Yesu ualisholuele kuli Ikeye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Vilinga 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Hakati ka mutania omo njatondele kuheta muyehi na Ndamasika, kaha vuasi vuasi ceke ca humine muilu ca kuviazima catuile na kunjizengeleka. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Njauililile ha mavu kaha njevuile lizi lihandeka kuli yange ngualio, ‘Saulu, Saulu, nkuma vika uli na kunjipakesela?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Kaha njehuile nguange, ‘Nkuma yove iya Muene?’ Kaha lizi liakumbuluile ngualio, ‘Yange Yesu ua ku Nazaleta uje ulinakupakesa.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Vuno honi vaje vamala vakele hamo nange vamuene lika ceke vuno kuvovuile lizi lia uje uakele nakuhandeka kuli yange. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Kaha njehuile nguange, ‘Nkuma njilinge vati honi, Muene?’ Kaha Muene uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, ‘Katuka linga uye ku Ndamasika, kuje vakakuleka viuma vioshe vije viatonda Njambi ngeci uvilinge.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Kaha njapuile njikapuputua muomu ya kuviakuma ca ceke, kaha vaje njendele navo vanjikuatele ku livoko nakunjituala ku Ndamasika.”<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Mu nganda muje muakele yala umo lizina liendi ikeye Ananiyasi, uakulongua nakuononoka Lishiko lietu kaha vamusingimikile cikuma kuli voshe Vayunda vakele mu Ndamasika. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Uezile kuli yange, kaha uemanene kuyehi nange nakuhandeka nguendi, ‘Muanetu Saulu mona naua!’ Kaha ha ntsimbu ijevene njamuene naua nakutala kuli ikeye. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />“Ambahoni uahandekele nguendi, ‘Njambi ua vakukuluila vetu nakuhangula linga uzivuke cizango cendi, nakumona ngamba yendi uavusunga nakumuvua omo ahandeka na lizi liendi. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Muomu ukapua mukaleho uendi ku vantu voshe ku vije viunamono na ku vije viunovu. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Nkuma vikahoni ucili nakuvandamena? Katuka linga vakumbuitike, vaka konekela vupi vuove, hakusana lizina liendi.’<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu vamusana ngeci ambulule kuli vaje keti Vayunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Hanima ya kuhilukila ku Yelusalema, kaha ha ntsimbu ije njakele nakulombela mu Njivo ya Njambi, njamuene cimona, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />mu cimona cije njamuene Muene ahandeka kuli yange nguendi, ‘Zambulako huma mu Yelusalema vuasi, muomu vantu valimuno kuvasa kutambula vukaleho vuove vua hali yange.’” <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />“Kaha njamukumbuluile nguange, ‘Muene, vakevo vavenia vazivuka nguavo njakele nakuya mu vinjivo vioshe via malombelo via Vayunda kaha njakele nakuvakuta nakuvapupa vaje vatsilielele muli yove. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Kaha omo mukaleho uove Setefano muva mutsihile, kunjakele nange vene hakulitavasana navo ha kutsa cendi, kaha njaniungile tuzaku tua vaje vamutsihile.’” <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />“Ambahoni Muene uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, ‘Ya, muomu njikakutuma kulahako kuli vaje keti Vayunda.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Vantu vovuile vije viahandekele Paulu, kaha vaputukile kutambakana cikuma nguavo, “Kutuamutondele ou yala! Mutsiheni! Kapandele kuyoya!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Vakele nakutambakana cikuma na kuashanga vuzalo viavo, nakushauila livu muilu. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Kaha uje ntuama ua masualale va Loma uashikile vantu vendi linga vatuale Paulu mu vinjivo muvakakala masualale kaha uavalekele nguendi vamupupe ngeci vauane muomu vika Vayunda vakele nakutambekela nakumuluisa. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Vuno honi omo vamukutile ngeci vamupupe, Paulu uahandekele kuli ntuama uje uemanene kuje nguendi, “Nkuma linapu Lishiko kuli yove kupupa mundambo ua mu cifuti ca Loma uje kuvasompelele linga vauane mulonga uanalingi ndi?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Omo uje ntuama ua masualale uevuile evi, uayile kuli uje ntuama muka kushika nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, “Nkuma vika utonda kulinga? Ou yala ikeye napu mundambo uamu Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Kaha uje muka kushika ua masualale uayile nakuihula Paulu nguendi, “Njileke, nkuma unapu u mundambo uamu Loma ndi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Kaha Paulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Eyo.”<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Ambahoni uje ntuama muka kushika masualale uahandekele nguendi, “Yange ovu vundambo vua mu cifuti ca Loma njavulandele na vimbongo viavingi cikuma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Vuno honi Paulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Yange njasemukila muno vene.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Hajevene vaje vamala vatondele kuihula Paulu vamushondolekele nakuya kaha na uje ntuama muka kushika masualale naua uevuile liova, omo uakuzivukile nguendi nkuma Paulu uapuile mundambo ua mu cifuti ca Loma, vuno honi uamuhakele mu malienge.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu ku mesho a Mpunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Vuno honi uje ntuama muka kushika masualale uatondele muacili cuma cika Vayunda vakele nakuvangeya Paulu, kaha liamukuavo uashikile linga vazitule Paulu, kaha uashikile vakuluntu va vasasendote na vaka mpunga voshe ngeci vakunguluke. Ambahoni uatualele Paulu nakumuimika ku mesho avo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulu uatalele ntooma hali ije mpunga, kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Vamuanetu, visinganieka viange vinapu via vusunga ha ngila ije injinayoyo nayo ku mesho a Njambi nakuheta ku litangua lia lelo.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Kaha kasasendote uakama ua lizina lia Ananiyasi uashikile vaje vemanene kuyehi nendi linga vapupe Paulu kukanua. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Ambahoni Paulu uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Muavusunga vene Njambi akakupupa, yove civumbe cakukuita mufuitilo yakutoka (yove muka civembulu!) Uatumama aha linga unjisompe kuya na lishiko, vuno honi yove unapokola lishiko lia Mosesa mukuvashika linga vanjipupe!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Vamala vaje vemanene kuyehi na Paulu vahandekele nguavo, “Ulinakutuka kasasendote uakama ua Njambi!”<verse eid="ACT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Kaha Paulu uavakumbuluile nguendi, “Vamuanetu kunjazivukile nguange uapuile kasasendote uakama, muomu vacisoneka nguavo, ‘Keti uhandeke vupi hali ntuama ua vantu vove.’”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Vuno honi omo Paulu uamuene nguendi vamo va muje mu civunga vapuile Vasanduki kaha naua vakuavo vapuile Vafaliseho, uatambakanene ku mpunga nguendi, “Vamuanetu, yange nji Kafaliseho, mutekuluila ua Vafaliseho. Valina kunjisompa kuno muomu ya hakutsiliela cije cinjilinaco ca ha kusanguka ku vatsi.”<verse eid="ACT 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Kaha omo uahandekele evi, hajevene Vafaliseho na Vasanduki vaputukile vimpata, kaha vaka mpunga valipangele. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Muomu Vasanduki vahandeka nguavo vantu kuvakasanguka ku vatsi, kaha naua kukuesi tungelo cipue vimbembesi, vuno honi Vafaliseho vatsiliela muviuma vioshe evi vitatu) <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ambahoni vantu vaputukile kutambakana cikuma mukuhandeka, kaha vamo valongisi va mashiko a Mosesa vaje vakele ku mpunga ya Vafaliseho vemanene nakuhandeka na nzili nguavo, “Kutuauanene cuma cimo cacipi canalingi ou yala! Hamo cilivene muavusunga Cimbembesi cipue kangelo nahandeka kuli ikeye!”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Kaha omo vimpata viatualeleleho cikuma, uje ntuama muka kushika masualale uevuile liova nguendi hamo Paulu vamutavozola vimpindi vimpindi. Nankuma uashikile masualale kukovela hakati ka mpunga ije linga vakatundiseho Paulu nakumutuala ku vinjivo vivakatumama masualale.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Kuvutsiki vujevene Muene uemanene kuyehi na Paulu nakuhandeka nguendi, “Keti uivue liova! Unahana vukaleho vuange muno mu Yelusalema, kaha uanapande kulinga cifua cimo naua na mu Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vutumbe vua kutsiha Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Kaha liamukuavo cimene vamo Vayunda valiuanene nakutumba vutumbe vuavushueke. Valisingile nguavo naumo uahi alia cipue kunua kuvanga noho vanatsihi Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Kuakele vantu vakupulakana makumi auana vaje vatumbile vutumbe vuje hamo. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Ava vantu vayile ku vakuluntu va vasasendote na ku vakuluntu kaha vahandekele nguavo, “Tunalikutu tuva voshe nakulisinga nguetu naumo uahi amakela viakulia vioshe kuvanga noho tuatsihi Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Ambahoni yeni na vaka mpunga munapande kutuma lizi kuli ntuama uje muka kushika masualale va Loma ngeci anehe Paulu kuli yeni, mulikuise ngue mutonda kuuana vukaleho vuacili hali ikeye. Vuno honi yetu tulivuahesela kumutsiha ntsimbu kanda ahete kuno.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Vuno honi muehua ua Paulu ua yala uje uevuile ovu vutumbe, uayile ku vinjivo vivakakala masualale, nakukaleka Paulu viuma evi. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Ambahoni Paulu uasanene umo ua vaje vantuama va masualale nakuhandeka kuli ikeye nguendi, “Tualeni ou mukuenje kuli uje ntuama muka kushika masualale ali navimo vije atonda kumuleka.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Ambahoni uje ntuama uamutualele kuli uje ntuama muka kushika masualale nakuhandeka nguendi, “Ou cinzinda Paulu nanjisana na kunjilomba nguendi njinehe ou mukuenje kuli yove, kuli vimo atonda kukuleka.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Kaha uje ntuama uakuatele ku livoko lia uje mukueje, nakuya nendi kumukulo, nakumuihula nguendi, “Nkuma vikahoni utonda kunjileka?”<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Kaha uje mukuenje uahandekele nguendi, “Vayunda vaje vaka nzili yakama vanalitavasana kukulomba linga vatuale Paulu kuli vaka mpunga imene, mukulikuisa ngue vakatondesesa muacili ha vukaleho vuendi. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Vuno honi keti uvevuilile, muomu kuvali vamala vakupulakana makumi auana vaje vaka vakalishueka nakuvandamena Paulu. Vanalisingi linga keti valie viakulia cipue kunua mema kuvanga noho vanamutsihi. Vanalivuahesela laja kulinga eci, kaha vanavandamena lika yove ngeci uvatavese.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Kaha uje ntuama muka kushika masualale uahandekele nguendi, “Keti ulekeko muntu cipue umo nguove unahandeka evi kuli yange.” Kaha uashikile uje mukuenje linga aye.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu vamutuma kuli nguvulu Felekisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Ambahoni uje ntuama muka kushika masualale uasanene vantuama va masualale vavali kaha uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Ambateni masualale vakupua vihita vivali (200) valivuahesele kuya ku Sesaliya, hamolika na makumi atanu na avali avaje vakakuendela ha tuvalu na masualale vakupua vihita vivali (200) vaje vakakulua na makunga, livuaheseleni kukatuka ha ntsimbu ya mucitanu na viuana ya vutsiki vuno vene. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Vuaheseniko vamo tuvalu linga Paulu alondeho, kaha muheteseni muacili kuli nguvulu Felekisi.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Ambahoni uje ntuama muka kushika masualale uasonekele mukanda muje muakele mezi aua, <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Kalaundiase Lisiyase kalemesa, kuli Nguvulu Felekisi, vihindu. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Vayunda vakuatele ou yala kaha vatondele kumutsiha. Kaha omo njevuile nguavo mundambo ua mu cifuti ca Loma, njaile na masualale vange na kumuyoyesa. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Kaha njatondele kuzivuka vika vakele nakumuvangeya, nankuma, njamutualele kuli vaka mpunga yavo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Njauanene ngue nacimo cahi cacipi calingile cije vatondele kumutsihila cipue kumuhaka mu kamenga. Vakele nakumuvangeya viuma vije viakundama kuvihula via mashiko avo vavenia. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Kaha omo vanjilekesele nguavo vali na vutumbe vua kumuluisa, hajevene njasinganiekele kumutuma kuli yove. Njalekesa vaje vamuvangeyeye linga vamuhane mulonga ku mesho ove.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Masualale valingile muva vashikililemo. Vambatele Paulu nakumutuala vutsiki vuje vene ku cihela ca Antipatilisise. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Liamukuavo vaje masualale vahilukile kuvihela viavo nakuseza vaje vaka kuendela ha tuvalu linga vaye nendi. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Vamutualele ku Saseliya, kaha vahanene uje mukanda kuli Nguvulu, nakuhetesa Paulu kuli ikeye. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Nguvulu uatandele uje mukanda kaha uehuile Paulu nguendi uhuma ku mbonge muka. Omo uauanene ngue Paulu uatundile ku Silisha, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />kaha Nguvulu uahandekele nguendi, “Njikakuivuilila nga vaje vanakuvangeya vanahete kuno.” Ambahoni uashikile linga vaniunge Paulu mu mapela a Nguvulu.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Vayunda vavangeya Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Hanima ya matangua atanu Kasasendote Uakama Ananiyasi uayile ku Sesaliya na vamo vakuluntu na lihako umo ua lizina lia Tetulase. Vezile ku mesho a Nguvulu Felekisi na kumulekesa mulonga ua Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Kaha uasanene Paulu linga akovele mukati, kaha Tetulase uaputukile kuvangeya Paulu nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Uakalemesa Felekisi, kutuamenena cove ca mana cinatunehela ciyulo ntsimbu yakama, kaha viuma viavingi vinatenguluka linga vantu vetu vakale muacili. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Tunacitambula eci kuoshe na ku ntsimbu yoshe, kaha naua tuavuahelela cikuma kuli yove. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Kunjatondele kumipihisila cikuma ntsimbu yeni, cipue ngoco, njikulomba ukakeleko na ngozi nakuvuilila ku mezi etu amandende. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Tuauana ou yala kupua muntu ua kalua, uaputukile kulinga mpindangano hakati ka Vayunda mu cifuti coshe, kaha naua ikeye ntuama ya mpunga ya vaka Nazalite. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Ikeye naua uatondele kujualesa Njivo ya Njambi, kaha tuamukutile. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Vuno honi Lisiyase ntuama uje muka kushika masualale va Loma uezile, kaha na nzili yakama uatutambuileye. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Nga umuihula yove vavenia ou yala uasa kuuana kuli ikeye vioshe vije vitunamuvangeya.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Vayunda navo naua vamuvangeyele nguavo vioshe evi vinapu via vusunga.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu aliohela ku mesho a Felekisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Kaha Nguvulu uashovueyele Paulu linga ahandeke, kaha Paulu uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Njazivuka nguange yove unapu ulihako ua cifuti eci ha miaka yaingi, kaha njavuahelela cikuma kuliohiela yange vavenia ku mesho ove.” <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Nga utondesesa muacili, keti matangua a kupulakana matangua likumi na avali anahitimo ha njaililile nakulemesa ku Yelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Vayunda kuvanjiuanene njili nakulinga vimpata naumo mu Njivo ya Njambi cipue kuneha mpindangano mu civunga cipue mu njivo ya malombelo cipue mu nganda yoshe. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Kaha naua kuvasa kukuhana vukaleho vuacili ha viuma evi vali nakunjivangeya hano. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Vuno honi njitava cuma eci kuli yove nguange njikalemesa Njambi ua vakukuluila vetu mukukavangeya Ngila ije ivatumbula vakevo nguavo ya makuli. Kaha naua njikatsiliela mu vioshe vije vivanasoneka mu lishiko lia Mosesa na mu mavulu a tunanguizi. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Nange vene njikatsiliela kuli Njambi ngue muje mu vakatsilielamo vakevo, kutsiliela cije vatumbula nguavo kukakala kusanguka ca vaka vupi na vaka vusunga. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Nankuma njili nakulinga na nzili yange yoshe linga njikale na lishungu ku mesho a Njambi na ku mesho a vantu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Hakuhona kukala mu Yelusalema ha miaka yaingi, kaha njahilukileko mu kutuala vukuasi ku vantu vange naku kakombelela vinkombelo. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Omo yapuile ntsimbu ije njakele nakulinga eci vanjiuanene mu Njivo ya Njambi tele njinamanesa cilika ca kulilelesa. Kunjakele na civunga ca vantu cahi, cipue kuvatanganesa. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Vuno honi vamo va Vayunda vaje vahumine ku mbonge ya Asiya vakele kuje, vakevo vapandele kuija ku mesho ove nakunjivangeya nga vakele navimo viakunjiluisa. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Cipue tava ava vamala valikuno linga vahandeke mulonga uvanjiuanene nauo omo njemanene ku mesho a mpunga. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />Kuvanga lika mpamo ha cuma cimo cije njatambekele omo njemanene ku mesho avo nguange, “Mulina kunjisompa ku litangua lia lelo muomu njatsiliela nguange vatsi vaka sanguka.”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Ambahoni Felekisi, uje ualilongesele cikuma ha vimpande via Ngila ya Muene uemikile cije kusompa, “Omo Lisiyase uje ntuama muka kushika masualale akeja ambahoni njikasinganieka ha mulonga uove.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Kaha uashikile uje muka kuniunga linga aniunge muacili Paulu, vuno honi napande kumuhanako kupatuka cimo nakutava vavusamba vendi linga vamukuase.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu ahandeka kuli Felekisi na Ndulusiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Hanima ya matangua amo, Felekisi uezile na mpueyendi Ndulusila, uje uapuile Kayunda, uatumine vantu linga vakambate Paulu ngeci eje kaha akumuvuilile muje muahandeka via lutsilielo muli Kilistu Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Vuno honi Paulu uakele nakuhandeka ha vusunga, na kuliniunga, kaha na ha kuija ca Litangua lia kusompa, Felekisi uevuile liova kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Yahoni ha ntsimbu ino, omo njikauana ntsimbu kaha njikakusana naua.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Ha ntsimbu ijevene uasinganiekele nguendi hamo Paulu amuhanako vimbongo vimo, nankuma ha cuma eci Felekisi uakele nakusana Paulu ha vintsimbu viavingi ngeci ahandeke nendi.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Hanima yakuhita miaka ivali, Posiyase Fesitase uasuanene mucihela ca Felekisi kupua Nguvulu. Felekisi uatondele kuvuahelesa Vayunda, kaha uasezele Paulu mu kamenga.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paulu atuala vimpande viendi kuli Sezale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Hanima ya matangua atatu Fesitase uahetele mu mbonge, uahumine ku Sesaliya nakuya ku Yelusalema, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />kuje vakuluntu va vasasendote na vakuluntu va Vayunda vamulekele vimpande viakuuanena Paulu mulonga. Kaha valombele Fesitase, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />linga avakuaseko kutuma Paulu ku Yelusalema muomu vatumbile vutumbe vuakumutsihila mu ngila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Fesitase uakumbuluile nguendi Paulu vali nakumuniungila mu kamenga ka ku Sesaliya kaha naua na ikeye vavenia na singanieka kuhiluka kuje vuavuno. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Eceleni vantuama veni vamo vaye nange, nga kulicimo canapihisa ou yala, kaha vasa kukamuhana mulonga.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Hanima yakutumama navo matangua keti akupulakana matangua atanu na atatu cipue likumi, kaha Fesitase uayile ku Sesaliya, liamukuavo cimene uatumamene ha cituamo cendi cakusompela kaha uashikile ngeci vanehe Paulu kuli ikeye. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Omo Paulu uahetele, Vayunda vaje vahumine ku Yelusalema vamuzengelekele. Vanehele milonga yaingi hali ikeye yakumuluisa, vuno honi kuvakele na vukaleho. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Paulu ualiamenene ikeye vavenia nguendi, “Naimo yahi ngila injinapokuelamo Lishiko lia Vayunda, cipue kuluisa Njivo ya Njambi, cipue kuluisa Sezale.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Vuno honi Fesitase, uatondele kuvuahelesa Vayunda kaha uehuile Paulu nguendi, “Nkuma utonda kuya ku Yelusalema linga njikakusompele kuje ha milonga eyi ndi?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paulu uahandekele nguendi, “Njinemana ku mesho a mpunga ya Sezale, kaha kuje kukeko munapande kunjisompela. Nacimo cahi cinjinapihisa kuli Vayunda, ngue muje vene mu unazivukila nove. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Nga njapokola Lishiko nakulinga cuma ca cipi cije cinjinapande kutsila, kaha kunjikalombo kuteua. Vuno honi nga kuhesi vusunga ha milonga eyi ivali nakunjinehela, kaha naumo uahi akanjihana ku mavoko avo. Kaha njikatuala vimpande viange kuli Sezale.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Ambahoni Fesitase hanima ya kulitavasana na vaka kumunangula uakumbuluile nguendi, “Unatuala vimpande viove kuli Sezale, kaha kuli Sezale vene kukeko ku ukaya.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fesitase alumbunuina Muene Angilipa na Mbenisi mulonga ua Paulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Hanima ya matangua amo, muene Angilipa na Mbenisi vayile ku Sesaliya mukumeneka Fesitase. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Omo vakele kuje matangua amo, Fesitase uanehele mulonga ua Paulu kuli muene kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Kuli yala kuno yasezele Felekisi mu kamenga, <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />omo njakele mu Yelusalema, vakuluntu va vasasendote na vakuluntu va Vayunda vanjilekele via hali ikeye kaha vanjilombele nguavo njimuhane mulonga. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Kaha njavalekele nguange keti kufutisi yetu va Loma kuhisa muntu uje ivanavangeya mulonga, oku kanda alimone mesho na mesho navaje vanamuvangeya, nakumuhana ntsimbu ya kuliohiela ku mulonga uendi. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Omo vezile kuno, kunjasimbuile, kaha lia mukuavo njatumamene ha cituamo ca kusompela kaha njashikile uje yala nguange vamunehe kuli yange. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Kaha omo vaka kumuvangeya vemanene, kuvamuhanene mulonga uavupi ngue muje njavandamenene nguange vaka lingamo. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Vuno honi vakele nakulinga vimpata nendi ha lutsilielo luavo na hali yala umo ivatumbuile nguavo Yesu, uje uatsa, vuno honi Paulu hanga acili nakuhandeka nguendi acili nakuyoya. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Muomu njahonouele kutondesesa cimpande eci, njamuihuile nguange utonda kuya ku Yelusalema linga vaka musompeleko ha milonga eyi. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Vuno honi Paulu ualombele linga vamuniunge kaha na Sezale linga asinganieke ha mulonga uendi. Kaha njahanene mashiko kuli ikeye linga vamuniunge kuvanga noho njikamutuma kuli Sezale.”<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Ambahoni Angilipa uahandekele kuli Fesitase nguendi, “Njitonda njimuivue yange vavenia ou yala omo a handeka.” Kaha Fesitase uakumbuluile nguendi,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">“Imene ukamuvua.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu vamuneha ku mesho a Angilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Kaha liamukuavo Angilipa na Mbenisi vezile na kalua kakama, kaha vakovelele mu njivo muva kakungulukila civunga na vakuluntu va masualale na vamala ava vakakumona via nganda. Kaha Fesitase uashikile linga vakovelese Paulu mukati. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Kaha Fesitase uahandekele nguendi, “Muene Angilipa na voshe valihano netu, muamono ou yala uje ikeye Vayunda voshe valina kunjinehela vimpande viendi, voshe vamu Yelusalema na vamuno, vali nakutambeka nguavo kapandele kuyoya naua. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Vuno honi njauanene nguavo nacimo cacipi canalingi cahi cije canapandela kutsila, vuno honi omo ualilombelele kutuala vimpande viendi kuli Sezale, njatondele kumutuma kuli ikeye. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Vuno honi kunjesi na cimo hali ikeye cinjapandele kusonekela Sezale. Nankuma njamuneha hakati keni voshe, ngue cikumani kuli yove muene Angilpa, linga hanima yakutondesesa mulonga uendi, hamo njikakala nacimo ca kusoneka. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Muomu kucikamoneka muacili kuli yange kutuala cinzinda mu kamenga cakuhona kumonesa mulonga uendi.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Paulu aliohela ku mesho a Angilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Angilipa uahandekele kuli Paulu nguendi, “Uli na ntsimbu yakuliohiela yove vavenia.” Ambahoni Paulu uoluele livoko liendi kaha uaputukile kuliohiela ikeye vavenia nguendi,<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Muene Angilipa! Njamono nguange njavezika hakuliohiela yange vavenia kulitangua lia lelo ku mesho ove ha viuma vioshe vali nakunjivangeya Vayunda, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Muomu unazivuka muacili futisi na vihula via Vayunda. Nankuma njikulomba unjivuilile mukusimpa.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Vayunda voshe vazivuka vati njinayoyo hume kuvukuenje vuange. Vazivuka kuyoya kuange kuoshe, ha vantu vange na mu Yelusalema. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Ntsimbu yoshe vanazivuka, nga vatonda kuhana vukaleho ovu, njapuile umo ua civunga ca Vafaliseho vaje vaka kavangeya cikuma ngila ya muje tukalemeselamo Njambi yetu. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Kaha honi hano njinemana linga vanjisompe muomu njahaka lutsilielo mu cikulaheso ca Njambi cije calingile kuli vakukuluila vetu, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Eci cikeco cikulaheso cije miyati yetu likumi na ivali cije civatonda kumona cilishulisise muomu yakulemesa Njambi vutsiki na mutania. Muene Angilipa, muomu ya kutsiliela eci mukemo Vayunda vali nakunjivangeya evi! <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Nkuma vika muhandekela ngueni cacikalu kuli yeni kutsiliela ngueni Njambi akasangula vatsi?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Nange vene njasinganiekele kulinga viuma viavingi viakuluisa lizina lia Yesu uaku Nazaleta. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Evi vikevio njalingile mu Yelusalema. Ha kutambulako nzili ku vakuluntu va vasasendote, na kuhaka vantu vavengi va Muene mu kamenga, omo vavatsihile nange naua njatavele.” <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Njavazangamesele ha vintsimbu viavingi mu vinjivo via malombelo njesekele linga vaviane kutsiliela cavo. Kaha njanienguele cikuma navo ngeci njaile ku vinganda via vungezi na kuvayandeselako.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu avaleka kutenguluka cendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Vilinga 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Ha mulonga ou vene njaile ku Ndamasika na nzili yakama cikuma na Lishiko lia kuhuma ku vakuluntu va vasasendote. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Capuile mu ngila omo tele litangua lili hakati ka mutue, yove Muene, njamuene ceke ca kuviakuma cikuma kupulakana litangua cahumine muilu canjizengelekele na vantu vaje njendele navo. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Kaha tuva voshe tuauililile ha mavu, kaha njevuile lizi mu Cihevelu lihandeka kuli yange ngualio, ‘Saulu, Saulu! Nkuma vika ulinakunjipakesela? Ulina kulivulumuna yove vavenia omo ulinakuliohiela, ngue ngombe ua kulimisa aliatangela ku citi ca muene uendi.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Kaha njehuile nguange, ‘Nkuma yove iya Muene?’ Muene uanjikumbuilile nguendi, ‘Yange Yesu uje ulinakupakesa. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Vuno honi katuka njalisholola kuli yove linga njikuhangule kupua ngamba na mukaleho uange ha viuma evi unamono navije ukamona kulutue. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Njikakuamena ku vantu Vaisaleli navaje keti Vayunda kuje kunjikakutuma. <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />Ukatonesa mesho avo na kuvahumisa kumilima na kuvatuala ku ceke nakuvahumisa ku nzili ya satana nakuvatuala kuli Njambi, linga ha kutsiliela cavo kuli yange vaka vasambese ku vupi vuavo nakutambula muhela uavo hakati ka vantu vaje vanahangula Njambi.’”<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu avaleka vipangi viendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Nankuma Muene Angilipa, njononokele cimona cije njamuene cahumine muilu. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Vuno honi ha kulivanga njambuluile mu Ndamasika, namu Yelusalema ambahoni mu cifuti ca Yundeya, na hakati kavaje keti va Vayunda, njambuluile linga vatenguluke ku vupi vuavo nakuhiluka kuli Njambi nakulinga viuma vije vimuesa ngeci vanatenguluka. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Muomu ya cuma eci mukemuo vanjikuatele Vayunda mu Njivo ya Njambi kaha vatondele kunjitsiha. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Vuno honi na kulitangua lia lelo Njambi nanjikuasa, nankuma njihana vukaleho vuange kuli yeni voshe, vakuluntu na vanike. Vije vinjihandeka vinapu vimo vije vivahandekele laja tunanguizi va Njambi na Mosesa ngeci vikalingiua, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />nguavo Kilistu napande kuyanda nakupua ikeye uakulivanga kusanguka kuvatsi na kuambulula ceke ca kuovoka kuli Vayunda na kuli vaje keti Vayunda.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Kaha omo Paulu uakele nakuliohiela mu ngila eyi, Fesitase uatambekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Ove Paulu unazaluka! Kulilongesa cove cikuma cili nakukuzaluisa!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Vuno honi Paulu uakumbuluile nguendi, “Yove muene Fesitase, kunjazalukile! Vuno honi njili nakuhandeka mezi a cili a vusunga. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Kunjasa kuteua kuhandeka cuma eci kuli Muene Angilipa! Muomu njazivuka nguange azivuka cuma eci. Kaha unamonoho cimo hali umo na umo uavo voshe, muomu cuma eci kucalingiuilile mu vushueke. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Muene Angilipa, nkuma uatsiliela muli tunanguizi ndi? Njazivuka nguange utsiliela!”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Ambahoni Angilipa uahandekele kuli Paulu nguendi, “Nkuma muka ntsimbu kakandende lika uasinganieka nguove uasa kunjipuisa mukayesu ndi?”<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Kaha Paulu uamukumbuluile nguendi, “Cipue njilinge vuasi cipue mu ntsimbu yalaha, lilombelo liange kuli Njambi nguange yove na vaje voshe vali nakunjivuilila lelo vapue ngue munjinapu yange kuhumisako lika aua malienge!”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Ambahoni Muene uemanene, hamo na nguvulu na Mbenisi na voshe vaje vatumamene navo, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />kaha omo vakele nakuya, vahandekele kuli umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Ou yala viahi napihisa ngeci atse cipue va muhake mu kamenga.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Angilipa uahandekele kuli Fesitase nguendi, “Ou yala napandele kumuecela nga katualele vimpande viendi kuli Sezale.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paulu vamutuala ku Loma mu vuato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Omo vasinganiekele nguavo tuapande kujavuka nakuya ku Itali, vahanene Paulu na vakuavo vinzinda mu mavoko a Njuliasi mukuluntu ua mpunga ya masualale va Loma ije vatumbuile nguavo, “Masualale va Nguvulu.” <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Kaha tuakovelele mu vuato kuhuma ku Andalamitayame, vuato vuje vavuaheselele cimueja kuya ku vikuma via ku mbonge ya Asiya, kaha vasunuine vuato nakuya. Kaha Alisitakase uje Kamasendoniya uahumine ku Tesalonika, uakele hamo netu. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Liamukuavo tuahetele ku Sindone. Kaha Njuliasi uakele na ngozi kuli Paulu kaha uamutavesele kuya kuli vavusamba vendi linga vakamuhaneko vukuasi. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Tuahumine ku Sindoni nakuya. Muomu mpunzi yakele nakuhuminina kuje tuakele nakuya kaha tuakele na kukavangeya lika nkundu ya Sepulasi. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Hanima yakujavukila musinia lia cisali kuseza Silisha namu Pamefiliya, kaha tuahetele ku Maila mu Lisiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Kuje mukuluntu ua masualale uauanene vuato vuahumine ku Alekizandiya vuakele nakuya ku Itali, kaha uatukoveselemo.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Tuajavuile vuato kamandende ha matangua amengiko kaha tuauanene vukalu vuakama tele kanda tuhete ku nganda ya Sinindase. Kaha mpunzi yatuvindikile kutualelelaho na vungenzi vuetu, nankuma tuashuangesele lika nkundu ya Kelete kuje mpunzi kuyakele na kupekumukila cikuma nakuhita kuyehi na cikuma ca Salemone. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Tuashuenene kuyehi na cikuma na kukaluua cakama, kaha tuahetele ku mutambela uje vatumbuile nguavo vikuma viakuhona Vukalu, keti kulahako na nganda ya Laseya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Kaha tuakele kuje ntsimbu yalaha cikuma noho caputukile ku kaluua mu vungenzi vuetu, muomu ntsimbu ino litangua lia ku liumina via kulia tele linahiti laja. Nankuma Paulu uavananguile, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />nguendi “Yeni vamala njamono nguange vungenzi vuetu kuhuma hano nakuya kulutue vukakala na vukalu, vitenga vili mu vuato vikapihia, kaha naua na vuato vukapihia na miono ikanonga.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Vuno honi uje mukuluntu ua masualale uatavele via mukakuendesa vuato navije viahandekele vavenia vuato kupulakana viahandekele Paulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Kaha cije cikuma kucapuile cacili kukalaho mu ntsimbu ya cisika, nankuma vamala vakele na cizango cakusununa vuato nakueseka kuheta ku Fonikisi, nga citava linga tukakaleko mu ntsimbu ya cisika. Fonikisi capua cikuma camu Kelete cije catala mu kunto ya ngangela na mu mbuela ya ngangela.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpunzi yakama ha cisali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Omo mpunzi yaindende yahumine ku mbuela yaputukile kupekumuka kaha vaje vamala vasinganiekele nguavo vasa kutualelaho na vutumbe vuavo, linga vakokele ntongo ya vuato nakujavuka kuhita kuyehi na cikuma ca Kelete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Vuno honi vuasi vuasi mpunzi yakama ije vatumbuile nguavo, “Mpunzi ya mu kunto ya Ngangela,” yapekumukile cikuma kuhuma ku ntunda ya nkundu. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Kaha mpunzi yapupile ku vuato, kaha capuile ca cikalu cikuma kutalesa ntongo ya vuato kuvuizililo vuampunzi, kaha tuecelele vuato linga mpunzi ivupekumune. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Omo tuahetele ku nkundu yaindende ije ivatumbuile nguavo Kaunda, ku mutambela ua mbuela kuakele vukalu vumo vuno honi tuasele kukuta vuato vuavundende ku vuato vuakama linga vukale muacili. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Vakokele vuje vuato vuavundende kamandende nakuvukutila ku vuato vuakama. Vakele na liova cikuma nguavo hamo vuato vukakateya ha musekeseke uaha masima a cisali kuyehi na cikuma ca Limbiya, nankuma vavungile vije vintanga viendesele vuato na mpunzi nakuecela vuato linga vupekumuke lika na mpunzi. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Mpunzi yakama cikuma yatualeleho kupekumuka, nankuma, liamukuavo vaputukile kumbangela mu ndonga vitenga vimo vije viakele mu vuato, <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Kaha ha litangua lia mucitatu naua vombilile vimo viakulikuasesa ku vuato mu ndonga. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Ha matangua amengi kutuasele kumona litangua cipue vintanga ntanga, mpunzi yakele na kupekumuka cikuma. Kaha hamamanusuilo kutuakele na lutsilielo lua kuovoka.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Omo voshe vakele ntsimbu yalaha cakuhona kulia, kaha Paulu uemanene nakuhandeka kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vamala, nga muanjivuililile na kuhona kujavuka kuhuma ku Kelete ngue viuma evi kuviapihile na kuzimbala. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Vuno honi njimilomba honi nguange koleseni mitima, naumo uahi ueni a kazimbalesa muono uendi, kuvanga lika vuato vukevo vukapihia. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Muomu izau vutsiki kuli yange kunemanene kangelo ua Njambi kuje kunjakundama nauje njikalemesa, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />kaha uahandekele nguendi, ‘Keti uvue liova, Paulu! Uapande kuimana ku mesho a Sezale. Kaha Njambi na kuniungila voshe ava uli nakujavuka navo mu vuato.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Nankuma likoleseni, vamala, muomu njili na lutsilielo muli Njambi kaha cikalingiua vene ngue muje muananjilekelamo. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Vuno honi mankimba akatutuala kumo ku nkundu.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Omo vutsiki vua vulikumi na vuuana vuahetele, tuakele na kuhungumuka mu cisali ca Andiliya, omo tele hakati ka vutsiki kaha vakakujavula vasinganiekele nguavo vuavuno vaheta ku ntunda. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Nankuma vesekele kulova ca mema, kaha vauanene kulova capuile mamita makumi auana (40), omo kuahitile ka ntsimbu kakandende naua vesekele kulova ca mema naua, kaha vauanene kulova ca mema mamita makumi atatu (30) <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Kaha vakele na liova nguavo vuato vukahungumukila ku mavue, nankuma, vasoselele vikuateso viuana mu mema ku ntongo ya kunima ya vuato, kaha vavandamene nguavo kuce vuasi. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Ambahoni omo vaka kujavula vesekele kuteua kuhuma mu vuato, vahakele ka vuato kakandende mu mema linga vamuese ngue vaje vaya nakuhaka vikuateso vimo ku ntongo ya kulutue lua vuato. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Vuno honi Paulu uahandekele kuli uje mukuluntu ua masualale naku masualale nguendi, “Nga ava vaka kujavula vahuma mu vuato kaha ku mukovoka.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Nankuma masualale vavatuile mikole ije yakuatele vuato vuavundende nakuvuecela ngeci vuhungumuke.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Omo litangua tele kanda lice Paulu uavalambelele voshe ngeci valie viakulia nguendi, “Munakala na kuvandamena matangua likumi na auana, kaha ha ntsimbu yoshe eyi kumuakele nakulia viakulia. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Nankuma njimilambelela muvoshe linga mulieko vimo viakulia, ngeci muyoye, muomu naumo uahi akanongesa cipue cinkambu caku mutue uendi.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Hanima yakuhandeka evi, Paulu uambatele mbolo, nakutsantsela kuli Njambi ha mesho avo voshe, uaipazuile nakuputuka kulia. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Kaha voshe vasimpile kaha vambatele viakulia valile. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Tuva voshe tuapuile vihita vivali na makumi atanu na avali na vantu vatanu na umo tuakele muje mu vuato (276) <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Hanima yakulia nakukuta, vombilile tiliku mu cisali linga vuato vuehuke.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutavozoka ca vuato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Kaha omo kuacele, vakakujavula kuvazivukile kuje kuvakele, vuno honi vamuene cinkonde cimo cije cakele na museke seke, kaha vayonguele nguavo nga citava, vapande vakatutike vuato kuje ku museke seke. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Nankuma vavatuile vikuateso nakuviseza vivombele ha cisali mema, kaha ha ntsimbu ije vene vazituile mikole ije yakele ku vilapo vije viendesele vuato. Ambahoni vajunduile vintanga vije viakele kulutue lua vuato linga mpunzi ipekumune vuato kulutue, kaha tuasungamene ku cikuma. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Vuno honi vuato vuapupile ha museke seke uaha masima a cisali, kaha vuakakatelele, kaha kuvuasele kushuena, ha ntsimbu ijevene ntongo ya kunima ya putukile kutavozoka vimbazuvuila mbazuvuila na nzili ya mankimba.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Vutumbe vua masualale vatondele kutsiha vinzinda, linga keti kukale umo hamo atana nakuteua. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Vuno honi mukuluntu ua masualale, uatondele kuovola Paulu, uavavindikile kulinga vutumbe vuavo. Uashikile voshe vaje vasele kutana ngeci vatumbuke mu vuato vuasi kaha vatane nakuya ku ntunda, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />kaha voshe vaje vasaleleho vavakavele, oku valikuatelela ku mavaya vamo valikuatelele kuviuma vije via pokuozokele ku vuato. Mungila eyi vene voshe vahetele muacili ku ntunda.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Paulu mu Melita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Omo tuahetele ku ntunda cakuhona vukalu, tuauanene ngeci nkumani ije nkundu vaitumbuile nguavo Melita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Vavenia vaje vakele kuje vakele na ngozi netu. Kalunga uaputukile kunoka, kaha kuakele lisika kujevene, vatuvuekelele tuhia nakututambula muacili tuva voshe. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paulu uakunguluile mukuta uavikuni, kaha omo uahakele vije vikuni hacoto, uje linoka akuivua ku yukuma uahumine muje mutuhia na kumushuma nakuniengelela ku livoko liendi. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Vavenia vaje vakele kuje vamuene uje linoka ali nakuniengela ku livoko lia Paulu, valihandekesele ku umo na mukuavo nguavo, “Cilivene ou yala hamo uapua muka kutsiha, cipue vene novoka ku cisali vuno honi vusunga vua vanjambi kuvua mutavesele ngeci ayoye.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Vuno honi Paulu uamiangele uje linoka mu tuhia cakuhona kuvetua. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Vamutalele hamo a nzimba vuasi cipue kuuila ha mavu na kutsa. Vuno honi omo vavandamenene ntsimbu yakama kuakuhona kumona cuma cimo cacikalu calingiuile kuli ikeye, kaha vatenguluile visinganieka viavo, na kuhandekele nguavo, “Napu njambi.”<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Kaha kuyehi na mutambela uje kuakele mehia a Pambiliase, muene uaije nkundu. Uatutambuile muacili, kaha tuapuile tuvangenzi vendi matangua atatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Kaha ishe ya Pambiliase uakele mu mulili uendi na kuvavala cikuma masika sika na kutuhuka maninga. Kaha Paulu uakovelele mu mulili muje muakele, ualombelele kaha hanima yakulombela uamusalekele mavoko endi kaha uakangukile. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Omo eci calingiuile, voshe vaje vaka kuvavala vamuje mu nkundu vezile, kaha vakangukile. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Vatusingimikile cikuma, kaha omo tuasunuine vuato, vatongekelele mu vuato vioshe vije tuatondele ha vungenzi vuetu.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu ahuma ku Melita aya ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Omo kuahitile vingonde vitatu tuakovelele mu vuato vuje humine ku Alekizandiliya, vuje vatumbuile nguavo, “Vanjambi va Vampasa,” vuje vuakele kuje ku nkundu cisika coshe. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Tuahetele mu nganda ya Silakuse, tuakele kuje matangua atatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Kuhuma kuje tuajavukile mu vuato nakuheta mu nganda ya Lendile. Kaha liamukuavo naua mpunzi yaputukile kupekumuka ku mbuela, kaha mu matangua avali tuahetele mu nganda ya Puteoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Kuje tuauanene vaka kutsiliela vamo vaje vatulombele kukala navo matangua atanu na avali. Kaha tuahetele ku Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Kaha vaka kutsiliela va mu Loma omo vovuile nguavo tuneja, vezile kuhuma ku vinganda viakulahako via kulandesela via Apiyase na Vinjivo Vitatu via vangenzi mukuliuana netu. Omo Paulu uavamuene, kaha uatsantselele kuli Njambi nakulikolesa.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulu aya mu Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Omo tuahetele mu Loma, Paulu vamutavesele kukala mua lika liendi lika hamo na lisualale muka kumuniunga.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Hanima ya matanga atatu Paulu uasanene vakuluntu voshe va Vayunda linga valiuane hamo. Omo valiuanene hamo, uahandekele kuli vakevo nguendi, “Vamuanetu, cipue vene kunjalingile cimo ca kuluisa vantu cipue futisi ije ituatambuile kuli vakukuluila vetu, vuno honi vanjikutile mu Yelusalema nakunjihana ku mavoko a vaka Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Omo vanjisompele, vaka Loma vatondele kunjecela, muomu kuvauanene cuma cimo cije cinjalingile cije cinjapandele kutsila. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Vuno honi omo Vayunda vavianene eci, kaha canjilingisile linga njituale cimpande cange kuli Sezale, cipue vene nange kunjauanenene vantu vange mulonga. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Muomu ha cuma eci mukemuo njamisanene linga njimimone nakuhandeka neni. Yange njili mu malienge aua muomu ya lizina lia uje ivanatsiliela vantu Vaisaleli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Kaha vahandekele kuli ikeye nguavo, “Kutuatambuile mikanda yakuhuma ku Yundeya ya hali yove, cipue kuno kukuezile umo ua vamuanetu kuhuma kuje na muzimbu umo, cipue kuhandeka via vipi hali yove. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Vuno honi tutonda kuzivuka viyongola viove, muomu tuazivuka nguetu kuoshe vantu valinakuhandeka viakuluisa civunga eci cije mu uli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Omo vahanguile litangua liakuliuana na Paulu, vantu vavengi valikunguluile kuje kuakele Paulu kuhuma ku cimene kuheta ku cinguezi ua valumbunuinine muzimbu uendi ua Vumuene vua Njambi. Kaha naua uesekele kuvalumbunuina vukaleho vua Yesu ha kuvaleka mezi a mu lishiko lia Mosesa na mezi a mu visoneka via tunanguizi va Njambi. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Vamo vatavele mezi endi, vuno honi veka kuvamutsilielele. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Nankuma, vayile oku valinakuliviana hakati kavo vavenia, muomu Paulu nahandeka navo cuma eci nguendi, “Cimbembesi Uakulela uahandekele vusunga kuli vakukuluila veni hali kananguizi Isaya! <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Omo uahandekele nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Ya ukahandeke ku vantu ava nguove,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">kuivua mukevua, vuno honi kumukevuisisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">kumona mukamona, vuno honi ku mukamonesesa.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Muomu mitima ya vantu ava inapu yakuzeya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">vanaziki matuitui avo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">kaha vanalalameka na mesho avo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Kuteua mesho avo amona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">na matuitui avo akevua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">kaha mana avo akevuisisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">kaha vakatengulukila kuli yange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">kaha njikavakanguisa.’”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Kaha Paulu uamanusuile kuhandeka nguendi, “Munapande kuzivuka ngueni muzimbu ua Njambi uakuovoka vanautumu kuli vaje keti Vayunda. Kaha vakauivuilila!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Omo Paulu uamanusuile kuhandeka mezi aua, Vayunda vamusezele oku valinakulinga vimpata viakama hakati kavo vavenia.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Paulu uakele kuje miaka ivali mu njivo yakulifuetela ikeye vavenia, kaha uakele nakutambula voshe vaje vezile kuli ikeye nakumumona. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Uambuluile via Vumuene vua Njambi nakulongesa via Muene Yesu Kilistu nakusimpa na mutima uakupatuka.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>